Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:08.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.85,0:00:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Fique aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:18.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.54,0:02:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está fazendo aqui?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.71,0:02:23.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.83,0:02:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde eles estão?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.44,0:02:24.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.56,0:02:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cunhada, eles desceram.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:26.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.10,0:02:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem, agora saia da frente.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.95,0:02:27.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.07,0:02:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Saia já da frente, me deixe passar!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.21,0:02:28.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.33,0:02:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem uma reunião lá embaixo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.27,0:02:29.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.39,0:02:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kadir, saia da frente!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.35,0:02:31.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.47,0:02:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cunhada, por favor, não insista, não faça isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.07,0:02:34.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.19,0:02:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A porta!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:36.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.35,0:02:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Abram essa porta agora!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:38.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.16,0:02:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Abram essa droga de porta antes que eu arrombe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.96,0:02:40.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.08,0:02:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vocês estão escondendo aí dentro, caramba?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.40,0:02:41.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.52,0:02:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:41.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.09,0:02:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Abre a porta!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.81,0:02:43.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.93,0:02:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, o que você está fazendo aqui?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:44.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.13,0:02:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Abre essa porta agora!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.01,0:02:45.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.13,0:02:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, saia daqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.75,0:02:46.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.87,0:02:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cunhada!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.81,0:02:47.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.93,0:02:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Cunhada!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.19,0:02:48.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.31,0:02:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Abram logo essa porta!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.35,0:02:49.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.47,0:02:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.95,0:02:49.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.07,0:02:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kadir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:50.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.75,0:02:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha que eu vou usar a força!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.65,0:02:52.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.77,0:02:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Abre essa porta ou a gente põe abaixo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:54.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.36,0:02:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou quebrar tudo aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:57.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.50,0:02:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,O nível de oxigênio tinha caído, trocamos a máscara.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:58.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.10,0:02:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Limpamos as vias aéreas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.75,0:03:00.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.87,0:03:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,E administramos soro para suporte.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:02.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.57,0:03:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Por enquanto o quadro está estável.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.55,0:03:03.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.67,0:03:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,E então?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.32,0:03:04.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.44,0:03:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está bem, Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.99,0:03:06.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.11,0:03:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:21.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.14,0:03:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fique calma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:31.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.34,0:05:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.90,0:05:31.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.02,0:05:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:33.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.84,0:05:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya, respire fundo... mantenha a calma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.33,0:05:35.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.45,0:05:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu joguei terra sobre ele...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.33,0:05:36.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.45,0:05:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele morreu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.76,0:05:37.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.88,0:05:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.68,0:05:38.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.80,0:05:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é isso? Eu estou desmoronando...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:39.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.92,0:05:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma, fique calma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:40.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.36,0:05:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu Deus, eu estou enlouquecendo...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:41.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.76,0:05:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Fique calma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:42.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.32,0:05:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem algo acontecendo comigo...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:43.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.12,0:05:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu estou...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:44.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.44,0:05:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu perdi o juízo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:45.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.52,0:05:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Como isso é possível?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.52,0:05:47.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.64,0:05:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Você sabia disso?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:49.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.48,0:05:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Todo mundo sabia e ninguém me contou?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:50.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.28,0:05:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya, eu ia te contar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:54.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.56,0:05:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya, eu ia te contar, mas olha... não é uma coisa fácil de dizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.18,0:05:58.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.30,0:05:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês não iam me dizer? Como esconderam isso de mim?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.20,0:06:01.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.32,0:06:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya, eu não escondi de você.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:03.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.88,0:06:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Como não escondeu de mim?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:06.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.68,0:06:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Como é que eu não sabia disso?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:07.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.94,0:06:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Como você não me disse nada?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:09.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.48,0:06:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu ia contar, calma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:10.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.00,0:06:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, mas...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:28.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.96,0:06:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu tentei... procurei um jeito de falar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.14,0:06:30.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas não havia como dizer uma coisa dessas antes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.61,0:06:31.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.73,0:06:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Fique calma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:32.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.37,0:06:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Como posso ficar calma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.35,0:06:33.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.47,0:06:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya, se acalme!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.15,0:06:34.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.27,0:06:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,O que quer dizer com 'ficar calma'?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:36.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.31,0:06:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya, eu vou te explicar tudo, entenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:36.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.95,0:06:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu estou ficando louca!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.59,0:06:38.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.71,0:06:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Primeiro você precisa se acalmar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.39,0:06:46.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.51,0:06:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Como vou ter calma?! Ele esteve morto por um ano! O que eu passei durante esse ano inteiro... como eu não sabia de nada?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.71,0:06:54.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.83,0:06:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma, eu vou te explicar tudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.35,0:07:16.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.47,0:07:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya, não é fácil dizer uma coisa dessas! Se ponha no meu lugar! Um é meu irmão, a outra é minha mulher! Como eu ia te contar isso? Com que palavras eu explicaria essa situação, Alya? Me diga, me ajude!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:32.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.02,0:07:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya, veja... o Boran está nesse estado há um ano! Um ano inteiro assim! Como eu poderia dizer isso, Alya? Principalmente para você, como eu ia falar isso, Alya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.73,0:07:41.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.85,0:07:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Você acha que eu não queria? Que eu não queria gritar aos quatro ventos que o Boran está vivo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.63,0:07:49.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.75,0:07:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando fui a Istambul, quando vi o Boran e soube que ele estava vivo... você acha que não tive vontade de pegar o telefone e te dizer que ele estava vivo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.31,0:07:55.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.43,0:07:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Você acha que eu não quis carregar o Boran nos braços até o meio da mansão e gritar para todo mundo ouvir que ele está vivo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:56.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.87,0:07:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran está vivo...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.17,0:07:58.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
