Dialogue: 1,0:30:42.16,0:30:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês não sabem de nada...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.86,0:30:55.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:30:52.98,0:30:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que eu não sei?!
