Dialogue: 1,0:32:22.04,0:32:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.42,0:32:50.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:32:50.54,0:32:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.90,0:32:51.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:32:51.02,0:32:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe...
