Dialogue: 1,0:34:11.90,0:34:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não me contou?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.01,0:34:16.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:34:14.13,0:34:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu teria ficado.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.39,0:34:20.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:34:17.51,0:34:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu teria ficado lá, teria continuado sendo a mulher que você deixou.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.94,0:34:26.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:34:25.06,0:34:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você deixou aquele testamento?
