Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.48,0:37:16.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:37:15.60,0:37:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai se levantar.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.56,0:37:19.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:37:17.68,0:37:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai se levantar.
