Dialogue: 1,0:37:22.52,0:37:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai ficar bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.74,0:37:34.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
