Dialogue: 1,0:37:38.13,0:37:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sua mãe está aqui, eu estou aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.01,0:37:39.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:37:39.13,0:37:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou ao seu lado.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.02,0:37:41.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:37:40.14,0:37:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou com você.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.97,0:37:43.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:37:41.09,0:37:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não vai morrer nunca...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.09,0:37:49.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:37:47.21,0:37:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Graças ao meu bom Deus...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.98,0:38:19.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:38:15.10,0:38:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu tinha que descobrir pelo Şahin que o Boran estava vivo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.72,0:38:29.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:38:26.84,0:38:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Era assim que eu tinha que descobrir?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.60,0:38:30.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:38:29.72,0:38:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.46,0:38:33.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:38:30.58,0:38:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Que vergonha de vocês! Tenham vergonha!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.46,0:38:39.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:38:37.58,0:38:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenha calma, Sadakat...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.79,0:38:45.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:38:42.91,0:38:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi você quem mandou fazer isso? Foi você quem quis assim?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.65,0:38:55.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:38:50.77,0:38:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Para não desfazerem os negócios da família, vocês esconderam o meu filho aqui e ficaram esperando ele morrer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.55,0:39:03.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:38:59.67,0:39:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo menos hoje não faça isso! Pelo menos hoje fique em silêncio!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.56,0:39:07.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:03.68,0:39:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, que loucura você está dizendo?! Pelo amor de Deus, meça as suas palavras!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.60,0:39:09.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:07.72,0:39:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou será que foi você, Cihan, hein?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.48,0:39:12.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:09.60,0:39:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi você quem tomou a mulher do Boran?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.75,0:39:16.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:12.87,0:39:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Só porque se casou com ela, ia largar o seu próprio irmão aqui dentro para apodrecer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.95,0:39:17.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:16.07,0:39:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,O que a senhora está dizendo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.05,0:39:18.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:17.17,0:39:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Caia em si! Que tipo de absurdo é esse?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.83,0:39:21.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:18.95,0:39:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Então por que vocês não me contaram?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.76,0:39:22.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:21.88,0:39:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não me disseram nada?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.98,0:39:24.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:23.10,0:39:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu tinha que saber pelo Şahin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.36,0:39:26.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:24.48,0:39:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou vocês iam deixar o meu filho apodrecer aqui dentro, hein?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.66,0:39:28.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:26.78,0:39:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, você está ouvindo os absurdos que está falando?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.26,0:39:29.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:29.38,0:39:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.12,0:39:31.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:30.24,0:39:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A senhora está escutando o que sai da sua boca, mãe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.77,0:39:32.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:31.89,0:39:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ponha a mão na consciência!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.29,0:39:35.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:33.41,0:39:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Como é que a sua consciência suporta dizer uma coisa dessas, mãe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.49,0:39:36.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:35.61,0:39:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Como o seu coração tem coragem de falar isso?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.88,0:39:38.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:37.00,0:39:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, olhe bem, eu vou ter uma conversa séria com a senhora.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.60,0:39:42.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:38.72,0:39:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas agora a senhora está descontrolada. Mais tarde nós vamos conversar com calma.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.76,0:39:43.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:42.88,0:39:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Fique sabendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.64,0:39:45.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:43.76,0:39:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, nós é que pedimos para o meu irmão! Nós!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.66,0:39:47.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:45.78,0:39:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós decidimos que seria assim!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.06,0:39:49.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:47.18,0:39:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Para a senhora não sofrer um segundo baque se ele não resistisse, mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.70,0:39:50.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:49.82,0:39:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai viver!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.15,0:39:53.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:51.27,0:39:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai viver! O meu filho vai sobreviver!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.85,0:39:54.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:52.97,0:39:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran vai se levantar!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.39,0:39:55.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:54.51,0:39:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,É claro que ele vai se levantar!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.83,0:39:58.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:55.95,0:39:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi por isso que eu o trouxe de Istambul para cá, para ele viver!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.73,0:39:59.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:39:58.85,0:39:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A senhora entendeu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.34,0:40:05.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:00.46,0:40:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, pelo amor de Deus, nos deixe viver a alegria de saber que o Boran está vivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.95,0:40:07.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:05.07,0:40:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo amor de Deus, nos dê uma trégua e não envenene esse momento!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.38,0:40:09.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:07.50,0:40:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pare de envenenar tudo à nossa volta de uma vez por todas!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.86,0:40:11.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:08.98,0:40:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran vai voltar para casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.22,0:40:15.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:13.34,0:40:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai. Mas não agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.93,0:40:17.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:16.05,0:40:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Não! Ele vai agora mesmo! Vai agora!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.25,0:40:22.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:20.37,0:40:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, espere a noite cair.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.12,0:40:27.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:24.24,0:40:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou trazer o Boran na calada da noite. Por isso mandei todo mundo sair da empresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.12,0:40:29.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:27.24,0:40:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendeu? Ninguém pode ver o Boran! Está bem?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.69,0:40:33.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:29.81,0:40:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem... Eu vou ficar aqui do lado dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.35,0:40:36.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:33.47,0:40:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquele desgraçado do Şahin... de onde ele descobriu? Nare, foi você quem contou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.91,0:40:38.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:36.03,0:40:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A menina não tem culpa nenhuma! Não foi ela! Ele seguiu a gente!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.33,0:40:43.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:39.45,0:40:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha aqui: aquele ordinário veio me contar, e vai correndo contar para o Ecmel também!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.15,0:40:45.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:44.27,0:40:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou falar com ele.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.46,0:40:49.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:45.58,0:40:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Se ele ousar abrir o bico... se ousar falar, ele vai se ver comigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.54,0:40:51.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:49.66,0:40:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, nós vamos conversar com ele. Deixe ele falar.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.30,0:40:52.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:51.42,0:40:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu irmão disse que vai falar com ele.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.38,0:40:53.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:52.50,0:40:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe, nós vamos resolver isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.11,0:40:54.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:54.23,0:40:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu prometo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.96,0:40:56.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:55.08,0:40:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem, eu fico aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.39,0:40:58.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:57.51,0:40:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou ficar ao lado do Boran.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.39,0:40:59.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:58.51,0:40:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Não saio de perto dele por nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.83,0:41:03.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:40:59.95,0:41:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vou me afastar do meu filho de jeito nenhum.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.70,0:41:04.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:03.82,0:41:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou ficar aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.98,0:41:07.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:06.10,0:41:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.59,0:41:08.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:07.71,0:41:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Combinado?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.28,0:41:08.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:08.40,0:41:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Combinado.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.67,0:41:16.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:13.79,0:41:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde está o Şahin? Onde ele está?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.76,0:41:21.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:19.88,0:41:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Lá fora, irmão.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.84,0:41:24.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:22.96,0:41:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Segurem ele!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.45,0:41:27.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:26.57,0:41:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha cá.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.13,0:41:28.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:27.25,0:41:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Às suas ordens, meu Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.10,0:41:29.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:28.22,0:41:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde está o Şahin?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.20,0:41:30.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:29.32,0:41:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Está esperando lá fora.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.82,0:41:34.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:31.94,0:41:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya, se quiser, vá para a mansão.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.96,0:41:36.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:35.08,0:41:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou falar com o Şahin.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.39,0:41:39.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:37.51,0:41:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Avise a Pakize para organizar o retorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.56,0:41:40.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:39.68,0:41:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Está certo.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.47,0:41:42.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:40.59,0:41:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe, meu Cihan, nossas bocas estarão seladas.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.86,0:41:56.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:41:53.98,0:41:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Vão tomar um pouco de ar lá fora.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.43,0:42:13.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:42:11.55,0:42:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Qual é o seu nome?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.88,0:42:18.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:42:18.00,0:42:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Vurgun Çelebi.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.23,0:42:20.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:42:19.35,0:42:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Vurgun Çelebi...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.36,0:42:27.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:42:23.48,0:42:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Veja só: sem nos avisar, você o manteve vivo por nós.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.55,0:42:35.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:42:33.67,0:42:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Se o meu filho ainda respira...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.39,0:42:40.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:42:37.51,0:42:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...se as mãos dele continuam quentes, é graças a você, à sua coragem.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.43,0:42:47.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:42:42.55,0:42:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Pensei ter colocado meu filho no túmulo, mas você o arrancou de lá e o devolveu para mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.95,0:42:54.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:42:51.07,0:42:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu nunca esqueço o bem que me fazem.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.38,0:42:58.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:42:56.50,0:42:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gravo isso no fundo do meu coração.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.92,0:43:00.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:42:58.04,0:43:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu só fiz o que era o meu dever.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.12,0:43:01.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:01.24,0:43:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Apenas isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.21,0:43:05.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:03.33,0:43:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Se esperar mais do que isso de mim, estará enganada.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.29,0:43:10.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:07.41,0:43:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Não sou alguém puro a ponto de causar espanto a ninguém.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.81,0:43:14.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:10.93,0:43:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando a gente cumpre certas ordens, não sobra inocência.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.87,0:43:19.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:15.99,0:43:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ainda mais sem ter escolha: a inocência é a primeira a ir embora.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.33,0:43:24.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:21.45,0:43:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Esta noite levaremos o meu filho para a mansão.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.50,0:43:26.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:25.62,0:43:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,O seu lugar também já está definido.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.54,0:43:27.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:26.66,0:43:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Você também virá morar na mansão.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.22,0:43:30.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:28.34,0:43:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendido?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.67,0:43:42.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:40.79,0:43:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Por quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.42,0:43:48.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:46.54,0:43:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,O que está acontecendo aqui?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.00,0:43:49.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:49.12,0:43:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está fazendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.85,0:43:52.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:50.97,0:43:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou estudando, Demir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.69,0:43:53.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:52.81,0:43:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu tenho prova amanhã.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.41,0:43:55.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:53.53,0:43:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, esquece essa prova! Vai estudar para quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.75,0:43:58.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:55.87,0:43:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando você se formar, o seu emprego já estará garantido.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.15,0:44:01.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:59.27,0:44:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Se você quiser, eu compro aquela universidade inteira para você!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.85,0:44:03.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:01.97,0:44:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,E ainda te coloco como professora titular por lá.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.56,0:44:04.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:03.68,0:44:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Professora Zerrin...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.71,0:44:06.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:04.83,0:44:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Juro que isso soa muito bem aos meus ouvidos!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.27,0:44:08.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:07.39,0:44:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem aqui, quero te mostrar uma coisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.41,0:44:10.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:08.53,0:44:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, Demir, me deixa estudar em paz.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.82,0:44:10.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:09.94,0:44:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo amor de Deus!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.01,0:44:11.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:11.13,0:44:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.95,0:44:13.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:12.07,0:44:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha cá, quero te mostrar uma surpresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.93,0:44:14.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:13.05,0:44:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu te imploro, venha ver!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.89,0:44:14.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:14.01,0:44:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, venha.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.58,0:44:15.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:14.70,0:44:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.46,0:44:16.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:15.58,0:44:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha, venha, venha.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.60,0:44:17.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:16.72,0:44:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiz uma surpresa para você.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.24,0:44:20.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:18.36,0:44:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,É tão linda, você não faz ideia!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.14,0:44:21.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:20.26,0:44:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha, venha ver.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.58,0:44:22.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:21.70,0:44:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha só para isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.16,0:44:33.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:31.28,0:44:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi que você fez?!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.94,0:44:43.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:42.06,0:44:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gostou?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.51,0:44:46.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:43.63,0:44:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Se não tiver gostado, no depósito tem mais quatro ou cinco armários cheios!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.75,0:44:49.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:46.87,0:44:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,E brinquedo que não acaba mais, olha aí!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.95,0:44:54.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:50.07,0:44:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Comprei roupinhas tanto azuis quanto cor-de-rosa, juro por Deus!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.76,0:44:56.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:54.88,0:44:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Como ainda não sabemos o sexo do bebê...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.42,0:45:00.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:56.54,0:45:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Se você não gostar dessas, lá embaixo ainda temos cinco malas abarrotadas de roupas!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.36,0:45:05.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:01.48,0:45:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Na verdade, comprei tudo o que tinha nas lojas, teimosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.52,0:45:08.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:06.64,0:45:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não quero que você fique fazendo essas coisas!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.22,0:45:09.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:08.34,0:45:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Senhor Demir!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.31,0:45:10.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:09.43,0:45:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Já estou indo, já vou!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.41,0:45:13.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:11.53,0:45:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Dê uma boa olhada com calma.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.50,0:45:16.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:13.62,0:45:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Se tiver alguma coisa de que você não goste, trocamos na hora.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.17,0:45:16.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:16.29,0:45:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Combinado?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.18,0:45:17.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:17.30,0:45:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dê uma olhada aí.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.32,0:45:18.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:18.44,0:45:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Até já.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.77,0:45:36.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:33.89,0:45:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, o Şahin acabou de chegar.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.79,0:45:45.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:42.91,0:45:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Entra, Şahin, pode vir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.15,0:45:47.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:45.27,0:45:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, desembuchem de uma vez!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.73,0:45:49.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:47.85,0:45:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que esconderam de nós o que todo mundo já sabia?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.75,0:45:52.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:49.87,0:45:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém está tentando difamar o seu pai com essas bobagens que você inventa!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.51,0:45:53.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:52.63,0:45:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha ali: o Boran está deitado bem ali!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.10,0:45:55.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:54.22,0:45:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece um morto deitado.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.32,0:45:56.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:55.44,0:45:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sem vida.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.69,0:45:57.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:56.81,0:45:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,De olhos completamente fechados.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.45,0:45:58.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:57.57,0:45:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele não abre os olhos!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.47,0:46:00.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:58.59,0:46:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se mexe de jeito nenhum!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.55,0:46:01.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:00.67,0:46:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,E o responsável por ele estar assim é o seu pai!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.79,0:46:03.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:01.91,0:46:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Você ainda insiste em culpar o meu pai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.27,0:46:06.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:03.39,0:46:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Porque eu sei exatamente como as coisas aconteceram!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.23,0:46:08.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:06.35,0:46:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Só que eu ainda não posso provar, Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.26,0:46:10.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:08.38,0:46:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, a gente nem sabia se ele iria sobreviver!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.19,0:46:13.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:11.31,0:46:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi por isso que o meu irmão e o Kaya esconderam de todo mundo!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.35,0:46:17.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:13.47,0:46:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,E escondemos por apenas um ou dois dias, pelo amor de Deus! Nós também acabamos de descobrir!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.91,0:46:17.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:17.03,0:46:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Não façam isso, por favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.15,0:46:19.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:18.27,0:46:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A Alya também só soube agora há pouco.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.88,0:46:21.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:20.00,0:46:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,E foi você mesmo quem contou tudo para a minha mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.35,0:46:24.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:22.47,0:46:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,O irmão Boran ainda pode ser um alvo, Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.74,0:46:27.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:24.86,0:46:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele ainda corre risco de ser executado!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.42,0:46:28.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:27.54,0:46:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Então vocês estão com medo do meu pai, é isso?!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.12,0:46:31.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:29.24,0:46:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,O seu pai não coloca medo em ninguém aqui, Şahin!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.81,0:46:34.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:31.93,0:46:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós defenderemos o nosso irmão à custa da nossa própria vida!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.32,0:46:35.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:34.44,0:46:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixa ele tentar encostar um único dedo para ver o que acontece!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.86,0:46:36.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:35.98,0:46:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Parem, parem com isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.05,0:46:38.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:37.17,0:46:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,O que ele quis dizer é o seguinte:
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.43,0:46:40.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:39.55,0:46:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,quem foi que o Boran matou?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.28,0:46:42.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:41.40,0:46:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi o Süleyman, não foi?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.76,0:46:45.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:42.88,0:46:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Se amanhã ou depois vier à tona que o Boran está vivo, o que vai acontecer?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.43,0:46:47.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:46.55,0:46:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A polícia vai invadir!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.58,0:46:48.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:47.70,0:46:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,O Demir vai vir atrás dele!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.83,0:46:49.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:48.95,0:46:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,O Nadim vai vir!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.45,0:46:51.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:50.57,0:46:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendeu agora?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.93,0:46:53.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:52.05,0:46:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ficou claro para você?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.45,0:46:55.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:52.57,0:46:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, você não vai abrir a boca para ninguém.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.53,0:46:57.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:56.65,0:46:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai dizer uma única palavra para o seu pai.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.43,0:46:58.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:57.55,0:46:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, se você contar...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.47,0:47:05.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:59.59,0:47:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,...se você contar, não poderei mais ficar com você, volto direto para a minha casa!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.95,0:47:13.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:47:08.07,0:47:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vou contar! Não vou contar a ninguém, juro que isso morrerá entre nós.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.39,0:47:33.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:47:30.51,0:47:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquele segredo... era isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.06,0:47:53.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:47:47.18,0:47:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Era exatamente isso que a Mine sabia, e era isso que ela ia contar para o seu pai.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.80,0:48:04.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:00.92,0:48:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Deus permita que ele se recupere logo.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.78,0:48:06.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:04.90,0:48:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Se Deus quiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.91,0:48:07.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:06.03,0:48:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Podemos ir embora?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.83,0:48:08.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:06.95,0:48:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, vamos indo.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.83,0:48:09.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:07.95,0:48:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Até mais, irmão.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.65,0:48:12.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:09.77,0:48:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Vão com Deus, até logo.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.64,0:48:19.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:14.76,0:48:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,O quarto mais seguro para ele ficar na mansão é a adega de pedra.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.03,0:48:35.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:29.15,0:48:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Fale com o Doutor Yalçın e prepare tudo exatamente como ele exigir, do modo mais adequado.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.11,0:48:36.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:35.23,0:48:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode deixar comigo, irmão.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.67,0:48:38.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:36.79,0:48:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai, meu Deus...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.27,0:48:44.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:41.39,0:48:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é isso que você tem na mão?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.60,0:48:48.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:46.72,0:48:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,É melancia, Ecmel!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.28,0:48:51.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:49.40,0:48:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,É abobrinha, homem de Deus! Por acaso você está cego?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.40,0:48:52.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:51.52,0:48:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Fale direito comigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.47,0:48:54.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:53.59,0:48:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não gosto de abobrinha.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.77,0:48:55.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:54.89,0:48:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Não sabe disso?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.23,0:48:57.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:56.35,0:48:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Faça outra coisa para o almoço.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.57,0:48:58.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:57.69,0:48:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Puxa vida, agora virou crime?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.98,0:49:02.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:59.10,0:49:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Vá tomar café em bandeja de prata na casa da sua mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.80,0:49:05.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:03.92,0:49:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cresceu cheio de criadas ao seu redor...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.25,0:49:07.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:05.37,0:49:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...e me obriga a ficar aqui descascando abobrinha!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.56,0:49:10.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:07.68,0:49:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Até a abobrinha olha na minha cara e diz: 'Fidan...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.71,0:49:12.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:10.83,0:49:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,...onde foi que você veio se meter?'
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.14,0:49:15.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:13.26,0:49:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Porque você tem alma de serviçal, mulher.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.50,0:49:16.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:15.62,0:49:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Não fique resmungando.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.17,0:49:22.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:20.29,0:49:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Não arregale esses olhos para mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.54,0:49:25.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:23.66,0:49:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mande a Nare vir para a cozinha agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.88,0:49:27.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:25.00,0:49:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,De agora em diante é ela quem vai fazer as refeições.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.62,0:49:30.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:27.74,0:49:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A filha parida pela Sadakat... cozinhando na minha casa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.10,0:49:33.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:30.22,0:49:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela fazer a comida e eu comer? Deus me livre, não passo nem perto!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.85,0:49:35.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:34.97,0:49:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.94,0:49:38.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:36.06,0:49:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês levantaram e saíram sem tomar café da manhã, foram para onde?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.45,0:49:40.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:38.57,0:49:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Você saiu feito um raio e ela foi correndo atrás de você.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.55,0:49:48.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:47.67,0:49:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Chega!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.96,0:49:54.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:51.08,0:49:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois de séculos nós fomos tomar café fora.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.43,0:50:02.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:50:01.55,0:50:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é algum pecado?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.67,0:50:08.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:50:03.79,0:50:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,E já me levou alguma vez por acaso? Fui eu quem te pariu, sabia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.91,0:50:14.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:50:12.03,0:50:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas para tomar café com ela você sai em disparada.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.22,0:50:17.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:50:15.34,0:50:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pare com isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.82,0:50:20.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:50:18.94,0:50:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, chega.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.14,0:50:22.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:50:21.26,0:50:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Estamos indo para a empresa agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.40,0:50:22.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:50:22.52,0:50:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.09,0:50:25.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:50:23.21,0:50:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode ir na frente, eu já vou daqui a pouco.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.05,0:50:25.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:50:25.17,0:50:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.00,0:50:27.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:50:26.12,0:50:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se atrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.62,0:50:30.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:50:26.74,0:50:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Não ligue para as palavras vazias dela.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.34,0:50:54.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:50:52.46,0:50:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe, não tem problema.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.91,0:51:00.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:50:58.03,0:51:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Você guardou segredo...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.69,0:51:07.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:05.81,0:51:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigada.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.14,0:51:11.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:09.26,0:51:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está aqui comigo só porque mantive a boca fechada?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.88,0:51:14.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:12.00,0:51:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou aqui porque te amo demais.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.84,0:51:26.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:21.96,0:51:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,E eu sei perfeitamente que você também se calou porque me ama.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.22,0:51:38.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:35.34,0:51:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora preciso ir para a empresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.41,0:51:47.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:45.53,0:51:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fique com Deus, até logo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.79,0:51:55.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:53.91,0:51:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ô Pakize, mulher...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.89,0:52:02.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:01.01,0:52:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,E se nós tivermos entendido tudo errado, hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.77,0:52:04.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:02.89,0:52:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,E se for um grande engano?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.87,0:52:05.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:03.99,0:52:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo amor de Deus!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.25,0:52:07.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:05.37,0:52:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A Dona Sadakat caiu desmaiada na frente de todo mundo!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.27,0:52:08.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:07.39,0:52:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,É a mais pura verdade!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.53,0:52:09.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:08.65,0:52:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está vivo mesmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.33,0:52:10.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:09.45,0:52:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas não é possível...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.98,0:52:12.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:11.10,0:52:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu Deus do céu, o Senhor é poderoso...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.10,0:52:13.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:12.22,0:52:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,É com essa provação que o Senhor está nos testando?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.82,0:52:15.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:13.94,0:52:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem dera a provação fosse apenas para nós!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.37,0:52:17.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:15.49,0:52:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,O peso do mundo sempre cai sobre a Dona Alya e o Senhor Cihan!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.63,0:52:19.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:17.75,0:52:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,E agora, o que vai ser da vida deles?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.04,0:52:22.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:20.16,0:52:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Logo agora que eles estavam começando a se amar, olha o que acontece!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.12,0:52:25.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:23.24,0:52:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas quem é que consegue encontrar a felicidade dentro desta mansão?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.30,0:52:27.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:25.42,0:52:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Não sei se a gente devia mandar benzer esta casa contra o mau-olhado...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.02,0:52:30.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:28.14,0:52:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai, meu Deus, e o que vai ser do menino, hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.31,0:52:33.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:31.43,0:52:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,O que será do meu Cihan quando souber disso?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.35,0:52:34.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:33.47,0:52:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando ele ouvir, quando descobrir...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.77,0:52:35.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:34.89,0:52:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem foi que descobriu o quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.69,0:52:36.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:35.81,0:52:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz, meu anjinho?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.67,0:52:38.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:36.79,0:52:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu querido, nós...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.23,0:52:40.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:38.35,0:52:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,...eu estava ensinando a preparar uma sopa deliciosa...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.53,0:52:41.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:40.65,0:52:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...para a sua tia Pakize.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.61,0:52:42.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:41.73,0:52:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, isso mesmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.91,0:52:42.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:42.03,0:52:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.15,0:52:46.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:43.27,0:52:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,É que eu acabei de picar cebola, por isso meus olhos estão cheios de lágrimas.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.39,0:52:48.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:46.51,0:52:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sempre fico aos prantos quando pico cebola, não é verdade?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.62,0:52:51.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:49.74,0:52:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem melão? Fiquei com muita vontade de comer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.88,0:52:59.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:52.00,0:52:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro que tem, meu bem! Vamos lá na despensa pegar. Desliga o fogo aí. Eu cheguei, meus afazeres demoraram um pouco, mas...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.96,0:53:38.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:53:31.08,0:53:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...já cheguei. Mamãe, por que elas estão chorando? Não estão chorando, meu anjinho, estão ocupadas. Venha, vamos para o quarto. Não chorem mais...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.85,0:54:06.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:53:58.97,0:54:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ümmü, não chore, pelo amor de Deus! Não tive coragem de olhar nos olhos dele, não consegui falar nada... Como se diz que o Boran está vivo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.83,0:54:07.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:05.95,0:54:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,É uma dor imensa... Nem fale uma coisa dessas em voz alta!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.67,0:54:08.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:07.79,0:54:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, pare de chorar.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.55,0:54:10.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:08.67,0:54:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Deus livre qualquer um de carregar um fardo tão cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.75,0:54:12.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:10.87,0:54:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, calma. Amém, amém.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.06,0:54:14.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:13.18,0:54:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,E agora, o que vai ser de nós?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.86,0:54:16.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:14.98,0:54:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Não sei, minha filha. Não faço ideia do que vai acontecer.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.18,0:54:19.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:17.30,0:54:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas veja bem: o meu Cihan deixou tudo muito bem avisado.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.36,0:54:21.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:20.48,0:54:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nossas bocas devem permanecer completamente seladas.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.84,0:54:22.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:21.96,0:54:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Está certo.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.46,0:54:24.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:22.58,0:54:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem em sã consciência espalharia algo assim por aí?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.55,0:54:25.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:24.67,0:54:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem precisava nos alertar sobre isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.73,0:54:30.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:27.85,0:54:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu Deus, o semblante da Dona Alya nunca teve um dia de paz.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.47,0:54:32.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:30.59,0:54:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, vamos. Vão para dentro agora, meninas.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.75,0:54:34.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:32.87,0:54:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, venha. Entre logo, vamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.89,0:54:36.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:35.01,0:54:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.86,0:54:43.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:37.98,0:54:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem o meu Cihan sorriu na vida... O rosto do meu Cihan nunca conheceu a alegria.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.76,0:54:48.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:44.88,0:54:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamãe, quando é que o papai vai chegar?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.78,0:54:50.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:48.90,0:54:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Os afazeres do seu pai demoraram um pouco mais hoje.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.97,0:54:52.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:51.09,0:54:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele já vai vir, meu amor.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.23,0:54:53.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:52.35,0:54:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas eu queria tanto que ele viesse logo...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.52,0:54:57.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:55.64,0:54:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Faz tanto tempo que a gente não brinca junto.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.84,0:55:00.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:54:58.96,0:55:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele já está chegando.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.99,0:55:03.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:01.11,0:55:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando ele chegar você me avisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.88,0:55:07.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:04.00,0:55:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamãe, por que você está tão triste?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.72,0:55:14.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:08.84,0:55:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Passei tantos dias me culpando achando que tinha matado meu marido...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.69,0:55:16.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:14.81,0:55:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Durante semanas isso me corroeu por dentro.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.33,0:55:19.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:17.45,0:55:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha consciência ficou em pedaços.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.79,0:55:21.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:19.91,0:55:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Por ter tirado o pai do meu próprio filho...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.69,0:55:23.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:21.81,0:55:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu me torturei dia e noite sem parar.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.11,0:55:25.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:23.23,0:55:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu me castiguei a cada segundo...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.77,0:55:31.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:28.89,0:55:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu só estou muito cansada, meu amor.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.57,0:55:39.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:37.69,0:55:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Porque você ficou de plantão no hospital hoje, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.01,0:55:42.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:41.13,0:55:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquei exausta.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.54,0:55:44.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:43.66,0:55:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Deita um pouco para descansar.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.73,0:55:50.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:47.85,0:55:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Se você quiser, eu até te ajudo a trocar de roupa.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.64,0:55:53.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:51.76,0:55:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Não precisa, meu príncipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.61,0:55:56.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:54.73,0:55:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Não precisa fazer nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.05,0:55:57.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:56.17,0:55:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Só quero uma única coisa de você.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.71,0:55:58.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:57.83,0:55:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.39,0:56:01.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:55:58.51,0:56:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Me dê um abraço bem forte... Venha cá.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.41,0:56:04.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:02.53,0:56:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha dar um abraço bem apertado na sua mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.28,0:56:08.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:05.40,0:56:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Quero sentir o seu cheirinho para que todo esse cansaço vá embora.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.84,0:56:11.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:09.96,0:56:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.54,0:56:12.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:11.66,0:56:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Diga, meu anjo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.12,0:56:18.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:12.24,0:56:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Você, eu e o papai vamos viajar para a praia, né? Mas tem que ser um lugar com bastante areia.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.02,0:56:21.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:19.14,0:56:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Porque nós vamos construir um castelo bem grande!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.71,0:56:26.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:21.83,0:56:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,O papai vai erguer as torres e eu vou colocar as bandeiras no alto.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.57,0:56:31.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:27.69,0:56:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Primeiro ele vai ajeitar a areia e depois eu vou molhar.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.28,0:56:34.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:32.40,0:56:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois vou catar pedrinhas bem pequenas...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.76,0:56:40.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:35.88,0:56:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,...para colocar em volta do castelo, e depois vou construir um vulcão!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.52,0:56:46.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:43.64,0:56:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando nós três formos, vai ser a coisa mais linda do mundo!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.40,0:56:52.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:46.52,0:56:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Alô, Erol? Assim que passar essa correria eu te ligo de volta, tá bom? Te ligo já.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.15,0:57:42.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:57:40.27,0:57:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele acabou dormindo, Alya?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.18,0:58:03.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:57:58.30,0:58:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele queria construir castelos de areia com o pai... adormeceu falando nisso.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.86,0:58:06.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:58:04.98,0:58:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Castelo de areia?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.32,0:58:10.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:58:08.44,0:58:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele queria construir um castelo de areia com você.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.83,0:58:22.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:58:19.95,0:58:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Castelo de areia, é?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.56,0:58:33.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:58:28.68,0:58:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No fundo, que desejo tão puro, né? Um sonho tão real e tão inocente.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.31,0:58:47.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:58:40.43,0:58:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Se eu soubesse disso apenas um dia antes, nós três teríamos ido juntos construir esse castelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.10,0:59:01.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:58:57.22,0:59:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,E quando o Boran chegar na mansão, o que vai acontecer?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.90,0:59:08.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:07.02,0:59:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.86,0:59:12.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:09.98,0:59:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Se o meu Deniz descobrir, o que vai ser de nós?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.60,0:59:19.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:14.72,0:59:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pense bem: ele tem certeza absoluta de que o pai está morto.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.15,0:59:23.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:21.27,0:59:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Durante todo esse tempo ele já se acostumou com essa dor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.83,0:59:25.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:22.95,0:59:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Se ele vir o pai naquele estado vegetativo...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.62,0:59:27.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:25.74,0:59:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma criança tão pequena vai sentir esse choque.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.02,0:59:30.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:27.14,0:59:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu mesma mal consigo suportar isso, Cihan...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.20,0:59:36.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:34.32,0:59:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem com todas as minhas forças eu consigo aguentar...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.98,0:59:40.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:36.10,0:59:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Como é que o meu menino tão pequenino vai suportar tamanho fardo?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.05,0:59:42.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:40.17,0:59:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Como é que eu vou explicar isso para ele?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.71,0:59:44.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:42.83,0:59:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Como é que eu vou contar?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.87,0:59:45.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:43.99,0:59:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,O que eu vou dizer?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.85,0:59:47.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:44.97,0:59:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não podemos contar.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.71,0:59:51.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:48.83,0:59:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A menos que ele acorde.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.73,0:59:58.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:55.85,0:59:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,E se ele nunca mais acordar...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.95,1:00:03.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:00.07,1:00:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,...bem, o Deniz nunca terá ficado sabendo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.85,1:00:06.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:03.97,1:00:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,E o que vai ser de nós dois?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.89,1:00:18.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:15.01,1:00:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer consigamos manter o Boran vivo...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.33,1:00:32.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:29.45,1:00:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...quer a gente não consiga...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.95,1:00:34.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:32.07,1:00:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...nada nunca mais será como antes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.57,1:00:39.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:37.69,1:00:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,E como poderia ser?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.88,1:00:44.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:41.00,1:00:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não consigo mais olhar nos seus olhos.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.50,1:00:48.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:46.62,1:00:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,E você também já não consegue mais me olhar daquele jeito.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.09,1:00:53.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:51.21,1:00:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Não conseguimos mais nos aproximar um do outro.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.46,1:00:55.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:54.58,1:00:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não podemos nos aproximar.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.30,1:01:04.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:58.42,1:01:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinto uma pontada profunda no peito, uma culpa imensa, como se estivesse traindo.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.69,1:01:10.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:08.81,1:01:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Você também vai se sentir assim?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.77,1:01:23.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:19.89,1:01:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Já estava sendo tão pesado para nós...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.41,1:01:28.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:23.53,1:01:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Até a gente conseguir aceitar nossos sentimentos, até nos acostumarmos...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.26,1:01:35.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:29.38,1:01:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora, com o Boran de volta a esta mansão, tudo será infinitamente mais doloroso.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.13,1:01:39.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:37.25,1:01:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pesado demais...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.97,1:01:47.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:43.09,1:01:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez a gente tenha que agir como um castelo de areia.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.24,1:01:49.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:48.36,1:01:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Não sei.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.52,1:01:54.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:51.64,1:01:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Você se ergue como um castelo de areia na praia.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.25,1:01:58.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:56.37,1:01:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Aí de repente vem uma onda violenta e te arrasta por completo...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.76,1:02:01.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:59.88,1:02:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...sem deixar vestígio algum.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.14,1:02:03.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:02.26,1:02:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Aí você junta forças e se reconstrói em outro pedaço de terra...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.22,1:02:08.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:04.34,1:02:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,...mas vem uma nova onda e te leva embora novamente.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.72,1:02:16.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:10.84,1:02:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,E você insiste: reconstrói outra vez, mais uma e mais outra... A vida é um pouco disso.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.65,1:02:21.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:17.77,1:02:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Por isso a gente nunca pode desistir de tentar.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.21,1:02:25.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:24.33,1:02:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não podemos nos render.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.49,1:02:36.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:32.61,1:02:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Os aparelhos médicos para o quarto do Boran já estão a caminho.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.49,1:02:38.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:37.61,1:02:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Devem chegar em instantes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.60,1:02:43.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:39.72,1:02:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,E hoje à noite eu vou até lá para trazê-lo para cá.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.46,1:02:50.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:44.58,1:02:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando ele estiver entrando, o Deniz não pode estar à vista de jeito nenhum.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.53,1:02:55.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:50.65,1:02:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos pedir para a Pakize mantê-lo ocupado no andar de cima, o que você acha?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.03,1:02:56.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:55.15,1:02:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, eu já deixei instruções sobre isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.55,1:02:59.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:56.67,1:02:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Senhor Cihan, Senhor Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.11,1:03:37.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:03:35.23,1:03:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A noiva do Senhor Kaya e a família dela acabaram de chegar na mansão.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.51,1:03:41.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:03:37.63,1:03:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Você por acaso combinou algum encontro para hoje?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.10,1:03:46.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:03:44.22,1:03:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.58,1:03:50.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:03:48.70,1:03:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha comigo agora.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.13,1:03:51.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:03:50.25,1:03:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tire isso, não tire!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.33,1:03:53.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:03:51.45,1:03:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tire a aliança.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.59,1:04:01.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:03:59.71,1:04:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Eles já chegaram?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.69,1:04:10.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:04:03.81,1:04:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Veja bem: no memorial aquele homem quis adiantar a data do casamento e você quase perdeu a cabeça.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.21,1:04:14.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:04:11.33,1:04:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não quero mais presenciar esse tipo de espetáculo, ficou claro?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.25,1:04:18.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:04:14.37,1:04:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tome uma decisão definitiva: esse casamento vai acontecer ou não vai? Decida-se de uma vez!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.99,1:04:21.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:04:18.11,1:04:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, com tudo o que aconteceu com o irmão Boran, minha cabeça virou um turbilhão.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.25,1:04:25.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:04:21.37,1:04:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não sei direito... Quer dizer, vai acontecer.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.18,1:04:28.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:04:26.30,1:04:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas vai acontecer se não for tudo atropelado e feito às pressas!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.53,1:04:30.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:04:28.65,1:04:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Não será às pressas.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.03,1:04:32.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:04:31.15,1:04:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pense muito bem.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.33,1:04:35.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:04:33.45,1:04:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,É uma decisão definitiva.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.18,1:04:56.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:04:51.30,1:04:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou receber os convidados e levá-los para a sala de estar.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.71,1:05:02.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:00.83,1:05:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,E não fique falando besteiras lá na frente deles.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.09,1:05:03.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:02.21,1:05:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Não me faça passar vergonha.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.33,1:05:04.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:03.45,1:05:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, eles estão entrando.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.59,1:05:05.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:04.71,1:05:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sustente a sua palavra.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.79,1:05:13.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:10.91,1:05:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Seja muito bem-vindo, Senhor Salih.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.28,1:05:15.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:14.40,1:05:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sejam bem-vindos.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.11,1:05:16.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:15.23,1:05:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito bem-vindos à nossa casa.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.20,1:05:19.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:17.32,1:05:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, subam para a sala de estar lá em cima.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.09,1:05:22.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:20.21,1:05:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpem o transtorno, estávamos resolvendo assuntos urgentes de trabalho.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.21,1:05:23.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:22.33,1:05:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sejam muito bem-vindos.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.01,1:05:24.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:23.13,1:05:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Por gentileza, fiquem à vontade e subam.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.71,1:05:24.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:23.83,1:05:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,İpek, olá! Seja muito bem-vinda.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.92,1:05:26.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:25.04,1:05:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Podem ir subindo que nós já nos juntamos a vocês.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.23,1:05:27.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:26.35,1:05:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sejam bem-vindos.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.24,1:05:28.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:27.36,1:05:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito bem-vindos.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.55,1:05:30.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:28.67,1:05:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.85,1:06:00.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:57.97,1:05:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Se a senhora quiser descansar um pouco, eu permaneço de vigília aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.86,1:06:01.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:00.98,1:06:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.10,1:06:04.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:03.22,1:06:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não saio de perto do meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.24,1:06:08.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:06.36,1:06:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Não me afasto dele nem por um único minuto.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.14,1:06:09.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:08.26,1:06:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu fico bem aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.07,1:06:12.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:11.19,1:06:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sei que a senhora está vivendo a imensa alegria deste reencontro.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.73,1:06:17.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:12.85,1:06:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Compreendo perfeitamente, mas este tratamento não é uma corrida curta.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.40,1:06:18.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:17.52,1:06:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Preciso lhe dizer:
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.31,1:06:19.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:18.43,1:06:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,será uma verdadeira maratona.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.87,1:06:21.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:19.99,1:06:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Se a senhora não descansar, vai acabar caindo de exaustão.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.77,1:06:23.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:21.89,1:06:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, de jeito nenhum!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.83,1:06:27.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:24.95,1:06:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Não existe essa história de desabar de exaustão para mim, nada disso!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.73,1:06:30.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:27.85,1:06:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sei muito bem como ter paciência.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.63,1:06:35.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:32.75,1:06:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,E sei muito bem como me manter de pé com firmeza.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.98,1:06:39.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:37.10,1:06:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Como a senhora preferir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.12,1:06:44.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:43.24,1:06:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Estarei sempre por perto.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.96,1:06:47.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:45.08,1:06:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu estou aqui, meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.00,1:06:48.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:48.12,1:06:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou bem aqui ao seu lado.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.65,1:06:50.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:49.77,1:06:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou ao seu lado, meu querido.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.75,1:06:51.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:50.87,1:06:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vou a lugar nenhum deste mundo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.94,1:06:56.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:54.06,1:06:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou aqui, meu filho, ficarei para sempre ao seu lado.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.09,1:07:00.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:59.21,1:07:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou aqui, meu amado.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.50,1:07:02.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:00.62,1:07:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Espero que não tenha acontecido nenhuma complicação grave.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.01,1:07:03.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:03.13,1:07:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigado.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.51,1:07:08.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:03.63,1:07:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pois a própria Dona Sadakat fez questão de exigir que viéssemos pessoalmente.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.44,1:07:09.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:08.56,1:07:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não há complicação alguma.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.40,1:07:14.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:10.52,1:07:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Surgiu uma emergência inadiável para a Dona Sadakat, por isso ela precisou se ausentar.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.15,1:07:19.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:14.27,1:07:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Cemile, Senhor Salih: o que aconteceu ontem no memorial entristeceu a todos nós.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.56,1:07:22.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:19.68,1:07:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas os senhores sabem muito bem que era o aniversário de falecimento do Boran.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.99,1:07:27.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:22.11,1:07:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,E os senhores compreendem perfeitamente o quanto datas como essa carregam um peso esmagador.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.60,1:07:31.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:28.72,1:07:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sob tamanha aflição, é natural que surjam momentos de tensão e desentendimento.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.70,1:07:33.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:31.82,1:07:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Por essa razão, peço que todos nos perdoem pelo mal-entendido.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.95,1:07:36.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:35.07,1:07:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas quero deixar algo muito claro aos senhores:
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.22,1:07:43.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:38.34,1:07:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,nós, como família, assim como o próprio Kaya, desejamos profundamente este matrimônio.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.77,1:07:52.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:51.89,1:07:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é verdade, Senhor Kaya?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.57,1:07:54.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:53.69,1:07:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,O que o senhor tem a dizer sobre isso?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.20,1:08:06.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:04.32,1:08:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ontem à noite aconteceu um lamentável mal-entendido.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.96,1:08:14.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:11.08,1:08:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas nós jamais tivemos a intenção de romper com o compromisso do casamento.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.41,1:08:22.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:14.53,1:08:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No entanto, como foi aventado ontem, realizar a cerimônia em apenas uma semana está fora de cogitação para nós.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.97,1:08:25.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:24.09,1:08:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pois estamos lidando com pendências muito complexas na empresa.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.12,1:08:26.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:26.24,1:08:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Compreendo perfeitamente.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.04,1:08:31.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:27.16,1:08:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Na verdade, nós também não tínhamos tanta pressa, mas como a Dona Sadakat insistiu com tanta veemência...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.76,1:08:32.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:31.88,1:08:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pois é.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.53,1:08:36.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:32.65,1:08:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas também é compreensível que não queiramos adiar indefinidamente.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.86,1:08:41.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:38.98,1:08:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sendo assim, proponho o seguinte acordo:
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.96,1:08:49.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:42.08,1:08:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,se for conveniente para todos os presentes, marcaremos a data do casamento civil para daqui a um mês.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.78,1:08:51.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:49.90,1:08:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Por mim, está perfeitamente de acordo.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.40,1:08:53.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:51.52,1:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Para nós também é uma ótima data, Senhor Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.45,1:08:55.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:53.57,1:08:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas haverá uma grande festa de casamento, não é verdade?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.65,1:09:01.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:58.77,1:09:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Com certeza absoluta haverá festa!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.82,1:09:10.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:07.94,1:09:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Celebraremos uma festa grandiosa, digna das tradições dos Albora.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.55,1:09:12.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:10.67,1:09:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora peço que me deem licença por um instante, preciso atender uma ligação urgente.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.57,1:09:13.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:12.69,1:09:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Fique à vontade, por favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.45,1:09:21.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:16.57,1:09:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya, meu rapaz, vocês pretendem realizar a comemoração aqui na mansão?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.67,1:09:25.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:23.79,1:09:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou estão pensando em alugar um grande salão?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.57,1:09:32.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:27.69,1:09:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos avaliar com calma, faremos onde for mais apropriado para a ocasião.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.45,1:09:40.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:38.57,1:09:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos logo.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.97,1:09:46.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:45.09,1:09:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ora, ora, Cihan!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.33,1:09:48.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:46.45,1:09:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não tínhamos combinado de nos encontrar para conversar?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.29,1:09:49.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:48.41,1:09:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sobre o assunto do Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.49,1:09:51.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:49.61,1:09:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, havíamos combinado. Diga de uma vez.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.61,1:09:52.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:51.73,1:09:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhe para este documento aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.11,1:09:58.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:56.23,1:09:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Viu só como eu sabia exatamente do que estava falando?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.71,1:10:05.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:02.83,1:10:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha, entre aqui para conversarmos.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.32,1:10:08.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:08.44,1:10:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.73,1:10:24.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:22.85,1:10:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sua saúde parece estar em dia, já que conseguiu vir até aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.15,1:10:26.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:25.27,1:10:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Graças a Deus a disposição está intacta, hein.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.78,1:10:28.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:26.90,1:10:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Digamos apenas que tenho uma constituição de ferro, Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.46,1:10:30.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:29.58,1:10:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ótimo.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.66,1:10:31.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:30.78,1:10:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Passei pela sua empresa mais cedo.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.23,1:10:33.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:32.35,1:10:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Estava tudo trancado a sete chaves.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.58,1:10:35.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:34.70,1:10:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Aconteceu alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.39,1:10:37.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:35.51,1:10:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,O que está escondendo por lá? Armazenou alguma carga proibida?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.56,1:10:38.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:37.68,1:10:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai fazer algum carregamento por estes dias?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.68,1:10:39.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:38.80,1:10:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso não é da sua conta.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.98,1:10:44.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:42.10,1:10:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Vá direto ao ponto principal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.86,1:10:45.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:44.98,1:10:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,O assunto tem a ver com o Kaya?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.89,1:10:47.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:46.01,1:10:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, diz respeito diretamente ao Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.10,1:10:47.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:47.22,1:10:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Então fale.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.99,1:10:50.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:48.11,1:10:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas a informação que trago vale ouro, Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.86,1:10:54.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:52.98,1:10:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Primeiro precisamos fechar um acordo comercial.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.34,1:10:55.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:54.46,1:10:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos negociar, então.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.52,1:10:57.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:55.64,1:10:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Quero que você me dê acesso à rota de transporte das suas cargas.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.34,1:10:58.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:57.46,1:10:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você disse?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.95,1:10:58.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:58.07,1:10:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Você aceita as minhas condições?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.95,1:10:59.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:59.07,1:10:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Aceito.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.04,1:11:05.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:00.16,1:11:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas não vai me cobrar aquela comissão de vinte e cinco por cento que você exige de todo mundo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.72,1:11:06.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:05.84,1:11:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quero pagar apenas cinco por cento.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.97,1:11:09.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:08.09,1:11:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ora, ora...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.71,1:11:11.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:09.83,1:11:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Você confia tanto assim nessa informação para fazer uma exigência dessas, hein?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.98,1:11:13.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:12.10,1:11:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cinco por cento.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.65,1:11:14.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:13.77,1:11:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Dez por cento.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.96,1:11:15.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:15.08,1:11:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,É pegar ou largar.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.32,1:11:19.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:17.44,1:11:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fechado, que seja dez por cento.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.32,1:11:19.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:19.44,1:11:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito bem.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.03,1:11:21.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:20.15,1:11:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora desembuche tudo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.19,1:11:22.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:21.31,1:11:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Que informação é essa?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.83,1:11:23.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:21.95,1:11:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, fale logo!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.87,1:11:34.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:29.99,1:11:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,O bebê que a Zerrin está esperando no ventre... aquela criança...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.36,1:11:41.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:37.48,1:11:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadim, escute aqui: a Zerrin negou isso veementemente!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.12,1:11:56.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:54.24,1:11:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela afirmou com todas as letras que não era dele! Em quem eu devo acreditar?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.40,1:11:59.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:56.52,1:11:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhe para este documento aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.48,1:12:07.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:01.60,1:12:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,O Demir Baybars jamais terá a menor condição física de ser pai nesta vida.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.06,1:12:16.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:13.18,1:12:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,O Demir é completamente estéril!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.33,1:12:27.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:20.45,1:12:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Fique com o laudo médico, mas o Demir jamais poderá sonhar que fui eu quem te entregou isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.20,1:12:39.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:36.32,1:12:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Para ser bem sincero com você...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.98,1:12:53.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:51.10,1:12:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...quando vim até aqui, meu coração estava saindo pela boca.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.10,1:12:56.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:53.22,1:12:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é imprevisível demais, é muito difícil tentar decifrar o que passa na sua cabeça.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.98,1:12:59.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:56.10,1:12:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas que droga... eu tenho essa fraqueza por coisas difíceis, fazer o quê?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.55,1:13:05.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:59.67,1:13:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, tente compreender a reação desmedida que tive por causa da Zerrin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.23,1:13:12.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:13:09.35,1:13:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Qualquer homem no meu lugar teria perdido a cabeça daquele jeito.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.38,1:13:15.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:13:12.50,1:13:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,E considerando o quanto eu amo você, eu até que me contive bastante.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.68,1:13:20.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:13:18.80,1:13:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas enfim...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.03,1:13:25.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:13:23.15,1:13:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vamos estragar a beleza deste dia com ressentimentos passados.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.87,1:13:34.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:13:30.99,1:13:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Vá com cuidado. A gente se vê por aí.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.16,1:13:37.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:13:37.28,1:13:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Até a próxima.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.04,1:13:53.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:13:50.16,1:13:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquele homem que acabou de sair era o Nadim?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.34,1:14:04.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:03.46,1:14:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Era o Nadim. O que ele veio fazer aqui?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.77,1:14:06.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:04.89,1:14:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Veio pessoalmente nos trazer um recado.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.44,1:14:07.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:06.56,1:14:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Veio direto até o nosso portão.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.68,1:14:08.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:07.80,1:14:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é isso que você está segurando?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.97,1:14:11.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:09.09,1:14:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Aconteceu alguma coisa grave?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.84,1:14:22.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:19.96,1:14:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Vá para perto do Doutor Yalçın.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.33,1:14:23.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:22.45,1:14:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Se ele precisar de qualquer coisa, ajude-o imediatamente.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.08,1:14:25.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:24.20,1:14:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu já vou descer para lá também.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.72,1:14:26.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:25.84,1:14:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem, já estou indo.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.37,1:14:31.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:29.49,1:14:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu, Cihan?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.44,1:14:32.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:31.56,1:14:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A pergunta certa é: o que não aconteceu nesta vida?!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.64,1:14:37.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:33.76,1:14:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,O que houve? O que aconteceu de novo desta vez?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.33,1:14:47.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:45.45,1:14:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.19,1:14:50.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:49.31,1:14:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Você pode me dizer de uma vez por todas o que está havendo?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.47,1:14:51.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:50.59,1:14:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Veja com os seus próprios olhos o que está havendo!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.67,1:14:52.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:51.79,1:14:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é este documento?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.14,1:14:54.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:52.26,1:14:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.13,1:14:58.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:56.25,1:14:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquele filho é do Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.99,1:15:06.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:04.11,1:15:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele estava dizendo a verdade o tempo todo?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.46,1:15:08.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:06.58,1:15:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhe aqui! O Nadim acabou de colocar este laudo médico nas minhas mãos!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.99,1:15:10.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:09.11,1:15:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya, você tem noção do que eu acabei de fazer agora há pouco?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.53,1:15:13.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:10.65,1:15:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Cinco minutos atrás eu selei a data do casamento do Kaya com a İpek!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.17,1:15:13.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:13.29,1:15:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu Deus...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.79,1:15:16.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:13.91,1:15:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo amor de Deus, que desgraça sem fim é essa que caiu sobre a minha cabeça?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.13,1:15:17.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:16.25,1:15:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A quem eu vou pedir paciência e resignação agora, Alya?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.99,1:15:21.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:18.11,1:15:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou pedir paciência para a İpek? Vou pedir para o Kaya? Para a mãe dele ou para o pai da noiva?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.20,1:15:23.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:21.32,1:15:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,De quem eu vou implorar piedade? Vou ter que clamar a Deus aos prantos?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.58,1:15:25.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:23.70,1:15:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sei, eu sei muito bem!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.20,1:15:28.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:26.32,1:15:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu tenho a obrigação sagrada de contar toda a verdade para o Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.06,1:15:28.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:28.18,1:15:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Não!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.90,1:15:30.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:29.02,1:15:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Como você terá coragem de dizer isso para o Kaya neste momento?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.75,1:15:32.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:30.87,1:15:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,O Demir vai ter que se divorciar imediatamente!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.11,1:15:32.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:32.23,1:15:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, mas...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.10,1:15:34.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:33.22,1:15:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Por acaso você acha que o Demir não sabia dessa esterilidade o tempo todo?!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.39,1:15:36.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:34.51,1:15:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele fez tudo de caso pensado, planejou cada detalhe de propósito!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.15,1:15:37.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:36.27,1:15:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele jamais vai abrir mão da Zerrin por livre e espontânea vontade!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.01,1:15:37.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:37.13,1:15:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.73,1:15:38.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:37.85,1:15:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquela criança no ventre dela é sangue do sangue Albora!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.49,1:15:40.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:39.61,1:15:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,O Demir Baybars vai assinar esse divórcio por bem ou por mal!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.63,1:15:45.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:43.75,1:15:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, pelo amor de Deus, não perca a cabeça!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.21,1:15:51.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:47.33,1:15:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fique calma e termine de organizar as coisas por aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.65,1:16:05.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:02.77,1:16:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Senhor Demir, o Cihan Albora está no portão principal.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.23,1:16:06.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:05.35,1:16:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele exige falar com o senhor com urgência.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.14,1:16:08.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:07.26,1:16:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Disse expressamente que precisa ser uma conversa a sós, senhor.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.64,1:16:11.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:10.76,1:16:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mande entrar imediatamente.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.44,1:16:12.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:11.56,1:16:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Às suas ordens, senhor.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.63,1:16:24.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:19.75,1:16:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu senhor está no andar de cima, aguardando por você.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.36,1:16:27.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:26.48,1:16:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Por aqui, por favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.55,1:16:33.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:30.67,1:16:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Suba, por gentileza, Senhor Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.45,1:16:43.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:42.57,1:16:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ora, vejam só se não é o próprio Cihan...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.50,1:16:48.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:44.62,1:16:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que meu pai andou baralhando a sua cabeça e você errou a mesa de negociações?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.34,1:16:50.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:48.46,1:16:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas lamento te informar uma coisa:
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.20,1:16:53.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:50.32,1:16:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,se não tiver uma proposta que passe de um mísero por cento de comissão...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.84,1:16:53.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:52.96,1:16:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...não aceitarei nada.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.91,1:16:55.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:54.03,1:16:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A porta da rua é logo ali, fique à vontade para sair.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.54,1:16:57.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:55.66,1:16:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu tenho uma proposta para você.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.30,1:17:00.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:57.42,1:17:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenho uma excelente proposta para te fazer.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.43,1:17:06.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:01.55,1:17:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas sente-se nessa cadeira para que eu possa te explicar com clareza.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.09,1:17:15.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:14.21,1:17:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Leia o nome que está gravado no topo desta folha.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.19,1:17:17.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:15.31,1:17:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Está escrito 'Demir Baybars'.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.07,1:17:22.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:18.19,1:17:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,E não é falsificação barata não, é absolutamente autêntico.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.66,1:17:26.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:22.78,1:17:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,E leia o que está escrito logo abaixo.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.12,1:17:35.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:30.24,1:17:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Pouco importa onde consegui isso, idiota! Leia com muita atenção o que está escrito aí!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.91,1:17:37.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:35.03,1:17:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan... onde diabos você conseguiu esse documento?!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.16,1:17:40.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:37.28,1:17:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Não interessa onde consegui! O que importa é que a verdade está nas minhas mãos!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.51,1:17:42.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:40.63,1:17:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhe para esse laudo!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.09,1:17:43.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:42.21,1:17:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Senta aí nessa cadeira, Demir!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.09,1:17:44.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:43.21,1:17:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.09,1:17:45.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:44.21,1:17:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, sente-se aqui, vamos conversar como homens civilizados!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.09,1:17:49.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:45.21,1:17:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Você leu com clareza o diagnóstico médico que está escrito aí?!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.87,1:17:51.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:48.99,1:17:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hein? O que é que este laudo oficial comprova?!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.66,1:17:54.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:51.78,1:17:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Demir Baybars é clinicamente incapaz de gerar um filho!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.75,1:17:56.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:54.87,1:17:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Cale essa boca!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.64,1:18:05.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:00.76,1:18:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,De quem é o filho que a Zerrin está gerando no próprio ventre?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.39,1:18:09.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:07.51,1:18:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,É do meu irmão Kaya, não é verdade?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.80,1:18:17.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:13.92,1:18:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai conceder o divórcio imediatamente!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.66,1:18:21.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:18.78,1:18:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não vou me divorciar dela nunca!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.29,1:18:22.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:21.41,1:18:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Demir, você vai assinar esse divórcio!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.77,1:18:24.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:22.89,1:18:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não vou assinar nada! A Zerrin é a minha legítima esposa!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.70,1:18:27.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:24.82,1:18:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A sua esposa está carregando no ventre o filho de sangue do meu irmão!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.93,1:18:28.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:28.05,1:18:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,O herdeiro de sangue do Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.30,1:18:30.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:29.42,1:18:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Caia na real de uma vez por todas!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.75,1:18:31.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:30.87,1:18:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai se divorciar dela!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.71,1:18:32.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:31.83,1:18:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu nunca vou me divorciar!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.69,1:18:33.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:32.81,1:18:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Demir!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.41,1:18:34.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:33.53,1:18:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Seu covarde desprezível!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.44,1:18:37.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:35.56,1:18:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tipo de verme sem escrúpulos você se tornou, desgraçado?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.68,1:18:38.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:37.80,1:18:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Homem mesquinho e sem caráter!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.83,1:18:40.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:38.95,1:18:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhe bem para as atrocidades que você cometeu!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.04,1:18:44.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:40.16,1:18:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não coagiu aquela jovem indefesa e a forçou a se casar com você contra a vontade dela?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.94,1:18:45.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:45.06,1:18:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hein?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.45,1:18:48.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:45.57,1:18:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela não sacrificou a própria juventude unicamente para livrar o próprio irmão da cadeia?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.72,1:18:49.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:48.84,1:18:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Não foi unicamente por isso que ela aceitou subir ao altar com você?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.14,1:18:54.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:50.26,1:18:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Você destruiu a vida do Kaya, arruinou a vida da Zerrin, destruiu a si mesmo e agora quer arrastar todos nós para o inferno, Demir!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.48,1:19:01.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:54.60,1:19:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Escute bem o que vou te dizer, rapaz: juro por Deus Todo-Poderoso, não ouse tentar medir forças comigo!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.78,1:19:05.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:01.90,1:19:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Se for preciso ser cruel, serei dez vezes mais implacável do que você! Não me force a agir da sua maneira imunda!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.55,1:19:11.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:06.67,1:19:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Se você não assinar esse divórcio por bem, cada palavra escrita neste exame será pregada em todas as paredes de Mardin!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.55,1:19:12.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:11.67,1:19:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A cidade inteira vai saber da sua vergonha!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.62,1:19:20.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:14.74,1:19:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Fui claro? Eu vou querer ouvir a notícia oficial do seu divórcio nas próximas horas!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.84,1:19:35.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:31.96,1:19:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Você fez isso de propósito, meu pai!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.17,1:20:02.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:58.29,1:20:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi você quem entregou aquele documento para ele!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.70,1:20:27.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:20:25.82,1:20:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está completamente louco, falando disparates.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.73,1:20:29.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:20:27.85,1:20:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi você quem armou isso!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.85,1:20:34.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:20:30.97,1:20:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Você entregou aqueles laudos confidenciais nas mãos dele!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.58,1:20:36.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:20:35.70,1:20:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhe para a sua atitude vergonhosa!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.71,1:21:23.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:21:18.83,1:21:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Você mesmo cavou a sua própria cova com essas obsessões!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.13,1:21:43.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:21:38.25,1:21:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Você jamais seria um pai de verdade para aquela criança, eu já tinha te avisado dezenas de vezes!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.70,1:21:48.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:21:45.82,1:21:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Você nunca será pai de ninguém!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.29,1:21:58.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:21:51.41,1:21:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Você jamais conseguirá erguer uma família de verdade se a mulher não for capaz de gerar um filho seu!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.38,1:25:43.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:25:38.50,1:25:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Alya, só está faltando o nosso kit do cateter de infusão.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.71,1:27:14.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:11.83,1:27:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou entrar em contato com o fornecedor do hospital e pedir com urgência.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.72,1:27:15.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:14.84,1:27:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Com certeza, faça isso por favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.55,1:27:20.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:15.67,1:27:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, onde você estava? Eu te liguei tantas vezes seguidas!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.44,1:27:24.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:21.56,1:27:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Havia um assunto inadiável que eu precisava resolver de qualquer maneira.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.40,1:27:26.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:25.52,1:27:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Estava cuidando disso pessoalmente.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.78,1:27:27.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:26.90,1:27:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Como ficaram os preparativos por aqui?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.19,1:27:29.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:28.31,1:27:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,O quarto já está praticamente todo equipado.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.98,1:27:33.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:30.10,1:27:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Graças a Deus a Dona Alya fez tudo o que estava ao alcance dela e nos prestou uma ajuda inestimável.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.94,1:27:34.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:33.06,1:27:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem, agora eu preciso me retirar.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.02,1:27:37.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:35.14,1:27:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando o Boran chegar na mansão, a Dona Alya já estará aqui para recebê-lo clinicamente.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.87,1:27:38.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:37.99,1:27:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigado, Yalçın.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.78,1:27:41.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:38.90,1:27:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas se surgir qualquer complicação inesperada, me avisem que retorno na mesma hora.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.77,1:27:42.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:41.89,1:27:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Combinado, muito obrigado por tudo.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.66,1:27:46.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:44.78,1:27:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada. Eu faço questão de acompanhá-lo até a saída.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.43,1:27:58.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:56.55,1:27:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigado a todos.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.04,1:28:14.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:12.16,1:28:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yalçın...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.81,1:28:17.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:15.93,1:28:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigado pela sua lealdade.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.31,1:28:19.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:18.43,1:28:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Saúde para todos nós. Bom trabalho por aí.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.43,1:28:22.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:19.55,1:28:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você resolveu com o Demir?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.91,1:28:28.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:26.03,1:28:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai conceder o divórcio. Ele não terá outra escolha.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.69,1:28:32.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:29.81,1:28:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, o que nós fazemos agora? Já podemos ir saindo com discrição?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.96,1:28:37.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:35.08,1:28:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós mesmos vamos buscar o Boran agora.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.07,1:28:50.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:47.19,1:28:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou deixar o carro discreto a postos. Nós seguimos na frente.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.08,1:28:50.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:50.20,1:28:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Com certeza.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.99,1:29:00.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:54.11,1:29:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Avise a Pakize para que, no instante em que chegarmos com o Boran, o Deniz não esteja em lugar nenhum à vista.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.29,1:29:01.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:00.41,1:29:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode deixar.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.07,1:29:08.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:07.19,1:29:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu já reforcei as recomendações a ela.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.58,1:29:23.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:20.70,1:29:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A remessa principal está a caminho.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.80,1:29:34.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:33.92,1:29:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Está tudo bem com você?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.69,1:29:35.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:34.81,1:29:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe comigo.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.82,1:29:37.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:36.94,1:29:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As mercadorias estão todas prontas para entrega?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.16,1:29:39.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:38.28,1:29:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Estarão completamente finalizadas dentro de poucos dias.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.41,1:29:41.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:40.53,1:29:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,E a carga do pó? Como está o andamento?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.73,1:29:42.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:41.85,1:29:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Já está sendo devidamente empacotada.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.89,1:29:43.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:43.01,1:29:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Excelente.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.16,1:29:47.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:44.28,1:29:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Embale de forma que fique bem escondido entre as mercadorias.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.61,1:29:49.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:47.73,1:29:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,O Şahin vai estar no carregamento.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.35,1:29:50.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:49.47,1:29:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Não deixe que ele desconfie.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.98,1:29:53.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:51.10,1:29:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Se ele descobrir o pó, incendeia o caminhão.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.82,1:29:55.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:53.94,1:29:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Por Deus, ele joga nós dois lá dentro.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.06,1:29:56.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:56.18,1:29:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.92,1:30:00.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:58.04,1:30:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Os homens sabem o que colocar e onde, Ecmel.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.54,1:30:01.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:00.66,1:30:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Se esta remessa der certo...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.20,1:30:04.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:02.32,1:30:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...vamos encher os bolsos e aumentar nossa moral.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.99,1:30:06.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:05.11,1:30:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois disso, tudo vai correr como água.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.19,1:30:08.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:07.31,1:30:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai dar certo.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.01,1:30:12.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:11.13,1:30:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem que dar certo.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.77,1:30:13.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:12.89,1:30:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai dar.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.36,1:30:17.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:16.48,1:30:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo, vou desligar.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.60,1:30:22.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:21.72,1:30:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem era?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.96,1:30:24.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:22.08,1:30:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Um velho amigo.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.13,1:30:27.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:25.25,1:30:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Perguntou algumas coisas sobre a empresa dele.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.56,1:30:34.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:31.68,1:30:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,E as mercadorias, em que pé estão?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.91,1:30:37.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:34.03,1:30:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mais um lote vai chegar, estou esperando por ele.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.98,1:30:39.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:37.10,1:30:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Que seja para o melhor.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.95,1:30:42.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:39.07,1:30:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu irmão, é urgente, precisamos conversar.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.15,1:30:51.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:50.27,1:30:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.13,1:30:52.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:51.25,1:30:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês preparem o Boran.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.42,1:30:53.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:52.54,1:30:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, senhor.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.28,1:30:54.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:53.40,1:30:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,O que houve?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.71,1:30:56.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:54.83,1:30:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Recebemos notícias do informante.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.62,1:31:00.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:56.74,1:31:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,O Ecmel vai contrabandear drogas no próximo carregamento.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.36,1:31:02.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:00.48,1:31:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer dizer que o Demir também está metido nisso.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.68,1:31:04.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:02.80,1:31:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Eles ficaram encurralados.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.17,1:31:05.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:04.29,1:31:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu Deus.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.43,1:31:07.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:05.55,1:31:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Deus me perdoe.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.08,1:31:09.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:07.20,1:31:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,O Şahin sabe disso?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.95,1:31:11.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:09.07,1:31:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Não sabe.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.83,1:31:15.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:11.95,1:31:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Descubram quando esse transporte vai ser feito.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.76,1:31:16.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:15.88,1:31:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,E me mantenham informado, entenderam?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.78,1:31:17.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:16.90,1:31:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe, Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.46,1:31:19.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:17.58,1:31:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos lá.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.24,1:31:20.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:19.36,1:31:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquem de olho, hein!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.38,1:31:22.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:20.50,1:31:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode deixar!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.02,1:31:48.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:46.14,1:31:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Senhor Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.92,1:32:46.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:45.04,1:32:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuidado.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.22,1:32:47.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:46.34,1:32:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Abriu?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.88,1:32:49.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:47.00,1:32:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A parte de trás abriu? Abriu.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.16,1:32:52.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:49.28,1:32:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu fecho as portas. Deixa comigo.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.08,1:32:57.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:55.20,1:32:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Levem por aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.34,1:33:43.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:41.46,1:33:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nada de correr, mocinho.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.89,1:33:53.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:51.01,1:33:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Para onde vai com essa pressa?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.10,1:33:54.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:53.22,1:33:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, suba lá pra cima.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.90,1:33:55.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:54.02,1:33:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos brincar!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.88,1:33:57.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:55.00,1:33:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês não estavam aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.97,1:33:58.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:57.09,1:33:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquei muito entediado.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.72,1:34:00.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:58.84,1:34:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou indo, vamos brincar.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.33,1:34:14.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:11.45,1:34:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, essa é a realidade desse menino.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.00,1:34:18.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:17.12,1:34:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,O menino não vai ver nada disso, mãe, está me ouvindo?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.79,1:34:22.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:18.91,1:34:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Virando a cara você não vai esconder a realidade.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.98,1:34:25.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:23.10,1:34:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, esse menino não vai saber de nada.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.87,1:34:27.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:24.99,1:34:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, essa criança não vai ver isso, mãe!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.95,1:34:30.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:27.07,1:34:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, saiam vocês. A gente se fala pela manhã.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.97,1:34:57.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:53.09,1:34:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu criei meus filhos para serem fortes como rocha.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.84,1:35:29.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:26.96,1:35:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,E você também é assim, meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.54,1:35:35.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:31.66,1:35:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo que leve um ano, cinco anos, dez anos...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.92,1:35:39.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:38.04,1:35:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...você vai se levantar de novo, vai se curar.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.82,1:35:42.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:40.94,1:35:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai se curar, meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.88,1:35:45.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:42.00,1:35:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Estes olhos ainda verão você sair por essa porta e ver o dia, meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.31,1:35:47.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:45.43,1:35:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai se levantar, meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.31,1:35:50.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:48.43,1:35:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai se levantar.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.88,1:35:56.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:54.00,1:35:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai se levantar.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.03,1:35:59.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:58.15,1:35:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu irmão vai se levantar, se Deus quiser.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.28,1:36:03.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:01.40,1:36:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,E vocês vão fazer de tudo por ele, ouviram?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.06,1:36:05.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:04.18,1:36:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem alguma dúvida disso, mãe?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.53,1:36:07.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:05.65,1:36:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,É claro que vamos fazer.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.92,1:36:08.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:07.04,1:36:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sempre estive ao lado dele.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.64,1:36:09.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:08.76,1:36:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,E vou continuar ao lado dele daqui em diante.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.89,1:36:14.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:12.01,1:36:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A sua mãe também está com você.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.51,1:36:17.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:15.63,1:36:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sua mãe está aqui ao seu lado, meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.73,1:36:19.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:18.85,1:36:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu guerreiro.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.71,1:36:21.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:20.83,1:36:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu estou aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.79,1:36:27.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:22.91,1:36:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo que você apenas durma e só respire, eu estou aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.63,1:36:31.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:30.75,1:36:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sua mãe está sempre aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.33,1:36:33.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:32.45,1:36:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.29,1:36:37.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:35.41,1:36:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.45,1:36:44.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:42.57,1:36:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.63,1:36:56.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:54.75,1:36:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Brinca você também.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.86,1:37:11.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:07.98,1:37:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, vem, vamos brincar juntos, tá bom?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.28,1:37:16.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:15.40,1:37:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.01,1:37:18.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:17.13,1:37:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamãe.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.76,1:37:19.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:17.88,1:37:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.46,1:37:21.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:19.58,1:37:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem, Cihan, me mostra.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.68,1:37:23.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:21.80,1:37:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai meu Deus, você está fazendo um telhado, é?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.92,1:37:24.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:24.04,1:37:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem cá.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.03,1:37:25.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:25.15,1:37:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.26,1:37:27.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:26.38,1:37:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Papai.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.69,1:37:28.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:27.81,1:37:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos ver.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.52,1:37:32.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:29.64,1:37:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Papai, a mamãe não quer brincar.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.49,1:37:34.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:33.61,1:37:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela está chorando.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.09,1:37:38.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:36.21,1:37:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Saia daqui!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.19,1:38:16.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:15.31,1:38:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Como disse?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.02,1:38:19.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:17.14,1:38:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não pode entrar aqui, saia daqui!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.79,1:38:23.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:20.91,1:38:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Vim examinar o Boran, Dona Sadakat.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.24,1:38:24.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:24.36,1:38:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Não!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.17,1:38:27.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:25.29,1:38:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Bote essa mulher para fora, você não pode entrar aqui!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.19,1:38:27.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:27.31,1:38:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,O que houve, mãe?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.34,1:38:33.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:28.46,1:38:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhem, esquecendo todo o resto, eu sou médica, por isso vou examinar o Boran, por favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.57,1:38:38.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:34.69,1:38:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,É exatamente por isso que não vai! Você vai tirar a vida do meu Boran!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.85,1:38:39.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:38.97,1:38:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.97,1:38:41.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:39.09,1:38:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, o que você está dizendo?!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.08,1:38:46.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:42.20,1:38:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa mulher vai tirar a vida do meu Boran para ficar com você!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.19,1:38:47.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:46.31,1:38:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bote ela para fora!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.17,1:38:49.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:47.29,1:38:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,O que a senhora está dizendo, Dona Sadakat?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.71,1:38:51.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:49.83,1:38:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que está me confundindo com você mesma?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.03,1:38:54.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:52.15,1:38:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,É a senhora quem puxa o gatilho sem pestanejar.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.39,1:38:57.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:54.51,1:38:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem destrói a vida de pessoas inocentes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.35,1:38:58.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:57.47,1:38:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.25,1:38:59.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:58.37,1:38:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sou médica.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.63,1:39:00.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:59.75,1:39:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu salvo vidas.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.13,1:39:03.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:02.25,1:39:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem tira vidas é a senhora.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.64,1:39:05.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:04.76,1:39:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chega!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.04,1:39:11.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:10.16,1:39:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Que vergonha de você, mãe...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.76,1:39:13.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:11.88,1:39:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao lado do Boran... Espere!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.42,1:39:15.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:13.54,1:39:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Como tem coragem de fazer isso ao lado do Boran?!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.40,1:39:16.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:15.52,1:39:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou sofrendo...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.84,1:39:16.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:15.96,1:39:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,É, mãe...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.26,1:39:17.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:16.38,1:39:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,E nós não sofremos?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.84,1:39:20.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:17.96,1:39:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não sentimos essa dor, mãe? Caia na real de uma vez!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.96,1:39:23.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:21.08,1:39:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Pare de falar qualquer absurdo que vem à cabeça!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.30,1:39:31.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:25.42,1:39:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Se tentarem apagar a dor machucando ainda mais, a pessoa esquece tudo o que aprendeu.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.17,1:39:37.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:34.29,1:39:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez seja preciso buscar a origem desse estado nas cinzas do primeiro incêndio.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.05,1:39:41.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:38.17,1:39:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu aprendi a respirar em meio a essa fumaça.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.02,1:39:46.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:44.14,1:39:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se metam no meu fogo nem nas minhas cinzas.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.06,1:40:14.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:11.18,1:40:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Por acaso fui eu quem quis que fosse assim?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.30,1:40:34.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:32.42,1:40:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fui eu quem deixou o Boran nesse estado?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.96,1:40:37.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:34.08,1:40:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu iria querer que ele passasse por isso?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.66,1:40:39.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:37.78,1:40:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Iria querer passar por tudo isso?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.91,1:40:42.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:41.03,1:40:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não conhece a minha mãe...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.71,1:40:44.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:42.83,1:40:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Conheço. Eu conheço a sua mãe muito bem.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.01,1:40:47.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:45.13,1:40:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu conheço muito bem a Dona Sadakat.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.27,1:40:49.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:47.39,1:40:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu já não sou a mesma Alya do dia em que cheguei aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.32,1:40:56.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:53.44,1:40:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas agora a situação é diferente.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.88,1:41:00.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:57.00,1:40:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A sua mãe sabe perfeitamente disso.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.95,1:41:09.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:05.07,1:41:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela sabe o quanto lutamos contra o que sentimos por dentro.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.98,1:41:12.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:10.10,1:41:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Por isso nos atinge cutucando bem em nossas feridas.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.85,1:41:14.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:12.97,1:41:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,É pesado demais.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.79,1:41:18.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:17.91,1:41:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou despedaçada.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.34,1:41:22.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:22.46,1:41:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,É difícil.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.84,1:41:25.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:23.96,1:41:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,É muito duro.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.03,1:41:30.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:28.15,1:41:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya, eu te amo.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.03,1:41:37.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:36.15,1:41:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu te amo muito.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.01,1:41:48.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:47.13,1:41:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Não consigo abrir mão do meu amor por você...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.68,1:41:51.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:49.80,1:41:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...nem consigo ignorar a situação do Boran.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.38,1:42:12.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:09.50,1:42:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quanto tempo vamos aguentar, Cihan?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.39,1:42:18.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:16.51,1:42:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Quanto tempo vamos suportar?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.95,1:42:34.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:31.07,1:42:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Fico tão feliz por ver meu irmão vivo, Şahin...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.61,1:42:54.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:52.73,1:42:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,...do fundo do meu coração.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.02,1:42:58.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:56.14,1:42:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas quando penso na Alya e no meu irmão Cihan...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.26,1:43:01.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:58.38,1:43:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...essa alegria vira dor num instante.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.75,1:43:07.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:03.87,1:43:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,É tão estranho... O quanto fico feliz, fico igualmente arrasada.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.51,1:43:14.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:13.63,1:43:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tem razão.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.82,1:43:24.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:21.94,1:43:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Era uma vez um homem, Nare.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.89,1:43:30.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:28.01,1:43:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele amava profundamente uma mulher.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.81,1:43:33.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:30.93,1:43:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, um dia, aquela mulher adoeceu.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.30,1:43:37.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:35.42,1:43:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ficou de cama, à beira da morte.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.24,1:43:39.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:38.36,1:43:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,O homem buscou todas as soluções.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.46,1:43:42.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:39.58,1:43:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Até que encontrou um curandeiro.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.84,1:43:43.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:42.96,1:43:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi até ele.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.84,1:43:45.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:43.96,1:43:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,E disse: 'Salve ela'.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.27,1:43:47.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:45.39,1:43:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,'Eu te darei o que você quiser'.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.15,1:43:48.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:47.27,1:43:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,'Darei até a minha própria vida'.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.13,1:43:49.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:48.25,1:43:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,'Contanto que ela se salve'.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.35,1:43:52.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:49.47,1:43:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,O curandeiro disse ao homem:
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.25,1:43:54.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:52.37,1:43:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,'Eu curo a sua mulher'.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.85,1:43:56.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:54.97,1:43:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,'Mas com uma única condição:'
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.38,1:43:58.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:56.50,1:43:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,'Você nunca mais olhará para o rosto dela'.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.25,1:44:01.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:58.37,1:44:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,'Se olhar, a perderá para sempre'.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.82,1:44:07.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:01.94,1:44:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A partir daquele dia, o homem nunca mais olhou para o rosto da mulher.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.53,1:44:10.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:07.65,1:44:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A mulher implorava para o homem:
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.22,1:44:12.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:10.34,1:44:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,'Por que você não olha no meu rosto?'
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.12,1:44:13.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:12.24,1:44:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,'Olhe para mim, vire-se!'
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.08,1:44:14.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:13.20,1:44:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,'Olhe para mim!'
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.27,1:44:16.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:14.39,1:44:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,O homem não aguentou mais.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.50,1:44:21.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:19.62,1:44:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Virou-se e olhou nos olhos da mulher.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.57,1:44:25.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:21.69,1:44:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,E com aquele único olhar, perdeu a mulher para sempre.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.73,1:44:33.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:28.85,1:44:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,O Cihan está exatamente no lugar daquele homem agora.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.45,1:44:41.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:38.57,1:44:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Não pode olhar... nem pode deixá-la.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.08,1:44:50.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:45.20,1:44:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, vendo a situação deles, passei a agradecer pela nossa família.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.16,1:44:53.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:52.28,1:44:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Existe sofrimento ainda maior que o nosso.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.47,1:44:57.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:55.59,1:44:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,O nosso caminho também não foi fácil, minha Nare.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.60,1:45:07.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:03.72,1:45:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim. Mas eu posso te abraçar e dormir com você agora.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.30,1:45:14.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:12.42,1:45:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,E isso é tão valioso, Şahin.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.03,1:45:17.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:15.15,1:45:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Temos que dar valor a cada segundo nosso.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.07,1:45:29.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:27.19,1:45:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A tudo que vivemos.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.14,1:45:37.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:33.26,1:45:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan... Acho melhor eu ficar no quarto do Deniz agora.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.38,1:45:48.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:47.50,1:45:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.61,1:45:52.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:50.73,1:45:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha... Venha cá.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.11,1:46:04.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:01.23,1:46:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Neste quarto, eu já senti tanta raiva de você.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.92,1:46:23.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:21.04,1:46:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugi tanto. E você fugiu também.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.25,1:46:29.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:25.37,1:46:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Porque nós já entendíamos nossos sentimentos.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.11,1:46:32.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:31.23,1:46:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No fundo, nós sabíamos.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.01,1:46:38.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:35.13,1:46:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Não conseguíamos admitir nem para nós mesmos, nem um para o outro.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.43,1:46:41.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:40.55,1:46:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Éramos teimosos.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.31,1:46:46.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:43.43,1:46:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Erguemos escudos e construímos um muro entre nós.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.87,1:46:48.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:46.99,1:46:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois, nós derrubamos esse muro.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.85,1:46:53.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:50.97,1:46:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Abaixamos os escudos.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.50,1:46:59.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:57.62,1:46:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Você me disse: 'Eu te amo'.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.20,1:47:04.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:02.32,1:47:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,E eu te disse: 'Eu te amo'.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.29,1:47:09.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:07.41,1:47:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Estamos de novo neste quarto.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.44,1:47:12.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:11.56,1:47:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas há um muro.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.28,1:47:17.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:14.40,1:47:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Só que desta vez não fomos nós que construímos esse muro.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.59,1:47:19.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:17.71,1:47:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Não fomos nós que fizemos.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.26,1:47:26.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:24.38,1:47:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Como vamos derrubá-lo?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.15,1:47:39.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:35.27,1:47:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Por isso, é melhor eu ficar no quarto do Deniz.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.91,1:47:48.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:46.03,1:47:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós nos odiamos, mas resistimos.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.34,1:47:53.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:51.46,1:47:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sofremos, mas resistimos.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.12,1:48:00.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:55.24,1:48:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nos apaixonamos, nos amamos, suportamos tudo... vivemos e fomos felizes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.09,1:49:15.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:11.21,1:49:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat não sai daquele quarto de jeito nenhum.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.82,1:49:33.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:31.94,1:49:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomou até o café da manhã lá dentro.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.51,1:49:35.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:33.63,1:49:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,E é fácil? É o filho dela, claro que vai ficar lá.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.79,1:49:37.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:35.91,1:49:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas se ao menos ficar ao lado dele fizesse ele melhorar...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.73,1:49:40.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:37.85,1:49:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sinto tanta pena da Dona Alya e do Senhor Cihan. Não é injusto?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.73,1:49:42.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:40.85,1:49:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,E também dá pena daquele homem.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.51,1:49:45.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:42.63,1:49:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Fica ali deitado... Isso é vida? Pode-se chamar isso de viver?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.88,1:49:47.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:46.00,1:49:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,E como se deve chamar isso, Pakize?!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.96,1:49:51.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:48.08,1:49:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Se isso não é viver, é o quê, menina?! Me diga!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.60,1:49:54.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:52.72,1:49:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat, por Deus, a senhora entendeu errado!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.46,1:49:55.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:54.58,1:49:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Por Deus, entendeu errado!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.06,1:49:56.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:55.18,1:49:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está querendo me dizer, então?!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.02,1:49:58.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:57.14,1:49:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Está dizendo que é melhor o Boran morrer, Pakize?!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.30,1:50:00.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:58.42,1:50:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat, como eu diria uma coisa dessas?! A senhora entendeu errado!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.46,1:50:04.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:00.58,1:50:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi errado, é?! Eu sou idiota por acaso, Pakize?!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.32,1:50:06.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:05.44,1:50:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Não bata nela!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.71,1:50:09.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:07.83,1:50:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Você também quer que ele morra?! Não?!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.17,1:50:13.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:10.29,1:50:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Você também quer a morte do seu patrão Boran?!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.99,1:50:15.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:13.11,1:50:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês querem que o meu Boran morra?!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.74,1:50:17.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:15.86,1:50:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,O que está acontecendo aqui?!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.12,1:50:17.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:17.24,1:50:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,O que houve?!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.90,1:50:18.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:18.02,1:50:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Eles...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.79,1:50:21.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:18.91,1:50:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Eles querem a morte do Boran!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.70,1:50:23.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:21.82,1:50:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim querem que o Boran morra?!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.26,1:50:24.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:23.38,1:50:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Espere um instante, Dona Sadakat, o que é isso?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.42,1:50:26.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:24.54,1:50:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi você que mandou?! É você quem manda falarem isso, não é?!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.58,1:50:28.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:26.70,1:50:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,O que a senhora está dizendo, Dona Sadakat?!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.18,1:50:29.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:28.30,1:50:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,É você!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.02,1:50:30.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:29.14,1:50:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,O que a senhora pensa que está dizendo, Dona Sadakat?!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.62,1:50:32.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:30.74,1:50:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Que absurdos está dizendo na frente de todos?!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.44,1:50:33.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:32.56,1:50:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Recupere o juízo de uma vez!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.08,1:50:36.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:34.20,1:50:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está querendo me colocar no meu lugar?!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.70,1:50:39.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:36.82,1:50:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Controle-se de uma vez, a minha paciência acabou!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.62,1:50:40.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:39.74,1:50:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, o que está acontecendo?!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.58,1:50:41.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:40.70,1:50:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha cá!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.38,1:50:44.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:42.50,1:50:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa garota está dizendo que ele devia morrer!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.66,1:50:45.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:44.78,1:50:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa garota vai embora!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.36,1:50:48.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:45.48,1:50:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela não vai mais ficar debaixo do meu teto!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.94,1:50:49.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:48.06,1:50:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai ficar na minha casa!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.08,1:50:50.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:49.20,1:50:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai sumir daqui!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.16,1:50:50.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:50.28,1:50:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, chega!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.94,1:50:51.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:51.06,1:50:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela vai embora!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.74,1:50:52.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:51.86,1:50:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chega!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.63,1:51:00.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:58.75,1:50:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Conte tudo, fale!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.91,1:51:04.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:02.03,1:51:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Como foi, me conte!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.58,1:51:06.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:05.70,1:51:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, conte!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.11,1:51:08.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:07.23,1:51:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,O que eu fiz?!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.59,1:51:11.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:08.71,1:51:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu juro que não quis dizer isso!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.85,1:51:12.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:10.97,1:51:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu juro que ela entendeu errado!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.49,1:51:13.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:12.61,1:51:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela não disse nada por mal...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.44,1:51:16.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:14.56,1:51:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat entendeu tudo errado!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.38,1:51:17.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:16.50,1:51:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cale a boca!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.76,1:51:20.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:17.88,1:51:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu Cihan, houve um mal-entendido.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.23,1:51:23.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:22.35,1:51:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém quis dizer isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.16,1:51:28.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:24.28,1:51:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela só estava com pena de você e da cunhada, mas...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.50,1:51:30.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:28.62,1:51:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...passou dos limites.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.82,1:51:35.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:31.94,1:51:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas se ela for embora, nós vamos embora também.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.51,1:51:41.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:39.63,1:51:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, não pode ser.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.40,1:51:47.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:46.52,1:51:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Se ela for, eu também...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.86,1:51:50.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:48.98,1:51:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Você também vai?!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.58,1:51:55.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:52.70,1:51:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém vai a lugar nenhum, Cihan!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.18,1:51:57.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:56.30,1:51:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém vai a lugar algum!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.24,1:52:01.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:59.36,1:52:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhe para mim.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.91,1:52:02.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:02.03,1:52:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi um mal-entendido.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.31,1:52:04.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:03.43,1:52:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Senhor Cihan...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.45,1:52:06.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:04.57,1:52:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Por Deus, foi um mal-entendido!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.01,1:52:07.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:06.13,1:52:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Peço mil desculpas ao senhor.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.12,1:52:10.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:08.24,1:52:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Peço mil desculpas.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.17,1:52:13.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:11.29,1:52:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês ouviram!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.36,1:52:16.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:15.48,1:52:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouviram bem!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.61,1:52:17.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:16.73,1:52:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém vai embora a lugar nenhum.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.10,1:52:21.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:19.22,1:52:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lave o rosto para se acalmar.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.49,1:52:21.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:21.61,1:52:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Vá.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.08,1:52:28.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:27.20,1:52:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha boa menina...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.60,1:52:29.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:28.72,1:52:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha querida.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.22,1:52:29.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:29.34,1:52:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma, menina.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.82,1:52:31.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:29.94,1:52:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,De jeito nenhum!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.42,1:52:34.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:31.54,1:52:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa garota vai sair desta mansão, Cihan!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.06,1:52:35.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:34.18,1:52:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela vai sair desta casa!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.10,1:52:35.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:35.22,1:52:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela não vai sair!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.90,1:52:37.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:36.02,1:52:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela vai sim! Você ouviu essa garota!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.23,1:52:41.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:38.35,1:52:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouviu com seus próprios ouvidos, ela disse que quer a morte do Boran!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.53,1:52:42.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:41.65,1:52:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer que o Boran morra!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.27,1:52:44.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:42.39,1:52:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou por acaso vocês também querem que o Boran morra?!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.93,1:52:45.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:44.05,1:52:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, do que você está falando?!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.10,1:52:47.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:46.22,1:52:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo isso sai da cabeça dela, não é?!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.79,1:52:50.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:48.91,1:52:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi ela quem plantou esse veneno desde o começo!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.31,1:52:52.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:51.43,1:52:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Chega!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.14,1:52:53.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:52.26,1:52:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Espere aí um instante!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.03,1:52:53.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:53.15,1:52:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Aonde você vai?!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.75,1:52:54.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:53.87,1:52:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ver o Boran.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.12,1:52:56.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:55.24,1:52:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai ver o Boran de jeito nenhum!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.22,1:52:56.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:56.34,1:52:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.86,1:52:57.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:56.98,1:52:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.54,1:52:59.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:57.66,1:52:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,O Doutor Yalçın está cuidando do meu Boran!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.50,1:53:00.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:59.62,1:53:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa mulher não vai encostar nele!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.36,1:53:03.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:00.48,1:53:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, ninguém quer a morte de ninguém!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.88,1:53:04.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:03.00,1:53:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém está provocando nada!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.48,1:53:06.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:04.60,1:53:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém está espalhando veneno!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.48,1:53:07.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:06.60,1:53:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Caia na real!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.69,1:53:11.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:08.81,1:53:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Se o Yalçın é médico, a Alya também é médica!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.56,1:53:17.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:13.68,1:53:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está começando a nos assustar, por Deus!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.10,1:53:20.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:18.22,1:53:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se meta, ouviu bem?!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.83,1:53:21.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:20.95,1:53:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem pense nisso!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.25,1:53:24.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:23.37,1:53:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês acabaram com a minha vida!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.88,1:53:32.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:31.00,1:53:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia, doutor.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.00,1:53:38.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:37.12,1:53:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.09,1:54:02.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:00.21,1:54:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A bolsa dele foi trocada?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.83,1:54:12.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:10.95,1:54:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, doutor.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.11,1:54:13.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:12.23,1:54:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A nutrição parenteral continua.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.37,1:54:14.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:13.49,1:54:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,O acesso central está estável.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.21,1:54:25.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:23.33,1:54:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Já estou indo.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.44,1:55:14.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:12.56,1:55:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está bem?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.91,1:55:35.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:33.03,1:55:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Cunhada, como ele está?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.26,1:55:38.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:36.38,1:55:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nenhuma mudança significativa.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.22,1:55:42.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:39.34,1:55:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou atrasada para o hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.62,1:55:43.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:42.74,1:55:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.62,1:55:59.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:54.74,1:55:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Deus nunca tire o Senhor Cihan e a Dona Alya das nossas vidas.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.84,1:56:03.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:02.96,1:56:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Amém.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.33,1:56:07.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:05.45,1:56:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Com uma exceção.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.94,1:56:17.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:15.06,1:56:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Menina...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.71,1:56:50.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:47.83,1:56:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Graças a Deus nós nos livramos dessa.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.14,1:57:02.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:59.26,1:57:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou seja, não se preocupe, não encuque com isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.42,1:57:05.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:03.54,1:57:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Se precisasse de novo, eu apanharia de novo.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.85,1:57:10.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:07.97,1:57:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando a patroa se irrita, fica daquele jeito.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.08,1:57:31.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:25.20,1:57:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No fim das contas, você só fez isso porque gosta do meu patrão e da Dona Alya.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.75,1:57:36.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:35.87,1:57:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não tem culpa nenhuma.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.52,1:57:46.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:40.64,1:57:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, qualquer noite dessas, eu preparo aquele charuto de cebola para você.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.65,1:57:50.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:49.77,1:57:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.85,1:58:04.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:59.97,1:58:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Alya, a Senhora Zerrin queria falar com a senhora.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.33,1:58:05.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:04.45,1:58:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela está te esperando no consultório.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.24,1:58:10.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:07.36,1:58:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem, obrigada. Vou guardar isso e já vou.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.45,1:58:11.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:10.57,1:58:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, doutora.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.37,1:58:16.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:14.49,1:58:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheguei.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.70,1:58:18.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:17.82,1:58:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está bem?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.67,1:58:20.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:19.79,1:58:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,O bebê está bem?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.63,1:58:21.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:20.75,1:58:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.66,1:58:23.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:21.78,1:58:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha cá, vamos ver...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.96,1:58:27.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:25.08,1:58:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sente-se aqui, sente-se.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.75,1:58:32.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:27.87,1:58:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Você contou para o Cihan sobre o bebê, cunhada Alya?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.08,1:58:34.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:32.20,1:58:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Contei.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.47,1:58:36.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:34.59,1:58:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha, sente-se um pouco.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.20,1:58:44.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:43.32,1:58:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,E o Kaya sabe disso? Não sabe...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.20,1:58:45.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:44.32,1:58:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro que não sabe.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.20,1:58:49.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:45.32,1:58:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sem ter uma resposta do Demir, o Cihan não dirá nada a ninguém, não se preocupe.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.87,1:58:50.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:48.99,1:58:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Que ele não diga!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.87,1:58:52.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:49.99,1:58:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo amor de Deus, que não conte a ninguém!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.87,1:58:54.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:51.99,1:58:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,O que faz aqui? Seja bem-vindo.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.91,1:58:57.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:58:56.03,1:58:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.88,1:59:02.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:00.00,1:59:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Vim buscar as encomendas que você pediu.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.88,1:59:05.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:02.00,1:59:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,O Kaya está lá embaixo cuidando disso.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.22,1:59:09.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:05.34,1:59:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, podemos conversar um instante? Precisamos falar.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.40,1:59:11.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:10.52,1:59:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Conversem.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.50,1:59:14.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:11.62,1:59:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha cá, sente-se aqui você também.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.77,1:59:19.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:17.89,1:59:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sente-se, conversem.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.36,1:59:26.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:24.48,1:59:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fale.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.19,1:59:32.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:32.31,1:59:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sobre a sua situação...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.51,1:59:35.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:33.63,1:59:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, por favor...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.83,1:59:37.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:35.95,1:59:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é que eu faça tanta questão...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.16,1:59:39.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:38.28,1:59:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,...mas ele vai se divorciar de você.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.68,1:59:41.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:39.80,1:59:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, ele não pode se divorciar!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.84,1:59:44.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:41.96,1:59:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Você sabe muito bem em quem ele pode se transformar!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.28,1:59:45.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:44.40,1:59:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Olhe, eu também sei.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.24,1:59:47.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:45.36,1:59:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu moro na mesma casa, eu vejo.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.79,1:59:49.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:47.91,1:59:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Quanto mais ele se fere, mais fica cego de fúria, por favor!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.71,1:59:51.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:49.83,1:59:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, por favor, não conte a ninguém!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.46,1:59:52.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:51.58,1:59:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu teria medo dele?!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.19,1:59:54.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:53.31,1:59:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,O Kaya teria medo dele?!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.89,1:59:56.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:55.01,1:59:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem teria medo?!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.83,2:00:02.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:59.95,2:00:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa criança no seu ventre é do meu irmão!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.48,2:00:03.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:02.60,2:00:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,É do Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.97,2:00:05.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:04.09,2:00:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendeu?!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.85,2:00:07.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:04.97,2:00:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Até onde sei, vocês ainda se amam.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.53,2:00:09.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:07.65,2:00:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A menos que algo tenha mudado.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.20,2:00:10.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:09.32,2:00:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Alguma vez nós conseguimos ficar juntos?!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.59,2:00:13.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:11.71,2:00:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai dar certo!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.55,2:00:15.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:13.67,2:00:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Desta vez também não vai dar certo!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.28,2:00:18.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:15.40,2:00:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Você conhece o meu pai... Se ele souber, não deixa viver!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.38,2:00:19.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:18.50,2:00:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Zerrin...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.76,2:00:21.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:19.88,2:00:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Não conte!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.52,2:00:24.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:22.64,2:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu já tomei a minha decisão!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.48,2:00:26.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:24.60,2:00:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Aconteça o que acontecer, eu não vou me divorciar do Demir!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.62,2:00:30.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:26.74,2:00:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,E você, por favor, não conte a ninguém, eu te imploro!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.28,2:00:32.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:30.40,2:00:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,O que houve? Seja bem-vinda.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.46,2:00:43.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:42.58,2:00:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Olá.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.04,2:00:45.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:43.16,2:00:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nare...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.92,2:00:49.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:47.04,2:00:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A Zerrin veio para uma consulta.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.09,2:00:52.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:50.21,2:00:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Passei para ver o Cihan...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.00,2:00:54.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:52.12,2:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...e pensei em passar aqui para ver você também.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.50,2:00:57.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:54.62,2:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, mandei aprontar tudo lá embaixo.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.74,2:00:59.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:58.86,2:00:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Está pronto?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.47,2:01:01.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:00:59.59,2:01:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ótimo, bom trabalho.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.67,2:01:09.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:08.79,2:01:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Não parece muito bem...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.05,2:01:10.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:10.17,2:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Zerrin...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.48,2:01:26.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:23.60,2:01:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Zerrin, esse bebê é do Kaya, não é?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.86,2:01:41.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:38.98,2:01:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha, vamos tomar um ar fresco.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.14,2:01:43.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:42.26,2:01:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha você também.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.56,2:01:45.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:43.68,2:01:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos respirar um pouco, tomar um ar.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.24,2:01:46.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:45.36,2:01:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos nos acalmar.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.06,2:01:46.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:46.18,2:01:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.45,2:01:50.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:48.57,2:01:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.18,2:02:01.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:58.30,2:02:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, posso te perguntar uma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.21,2:02:08.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:07.33,2:02:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pergunte.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.78,2:02:11.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:08.90,2:02:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Desde quando a Zerrin consulta com a cunhada?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.22,2:02:14.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:13.34,2:02:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sei lá.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.91,2:02:17.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:16.03,2:02:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,É que o médico dela era outro.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.70,2:02:19.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:17.82,2:02:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Achei estranho vê-la com a cunhada.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.24,2:02:24.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:22.36,2:02:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela conhece a Alya, Kaya...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.22,2:02:24.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:24.34,2:02:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.00,2:02:26.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:25.12,2:02:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...e ela é uma ótima médica.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.20,2:02:28.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:27.32,2:02:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Por isso foi até ela.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.33,2:02:36.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:34.45,2:02:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.55,2:02:37.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:36.67,2:02:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,O Kaya veio aí.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.88,2:02:38.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:38.00,2:02:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Chegou.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.61,2:02:41.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:38.73,2:02:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Esses carregamentos estão prontos?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.53,2:02:42.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:42.65,2:02:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegue.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.20,2:02:45.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:43.32,2:02:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou ligando para a minha irmã desde cedo...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.08,2:02:47.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:45.20,2:02:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...ela não atende o telefone. Não aconteceu nada de errado, né?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.77,2:02:50.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:47.89,2:02:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Não. Fique tranquilo.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.21,2:02:53.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:51.33,2:02:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,E o que deu sobre o caso do Ecmel? Já sabem o horário do transporte?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.44,2:02:55.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:53.56,2:02:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ainda não temos novidades.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.90,2:02:57.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:56.02,2:02:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também estou investigando. Vamos descobrir.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.10,2:03:00.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:58.22,2:03:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Descubram, hein. Não larguem o pé deles.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.51,2:03:02.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:00.63,2:03:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe, não vou largar. Desculpe agora, mas precisamos sair. Com licença.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.55,2:03:04.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:02.67,2:03:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Com licença.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.63,2:03:06.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:04.75,2:03:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom trabalho.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.67,2:03:08.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:06.79,2:03:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom trabalho.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.68,2:03:15.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:09.80,2:03:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, meu bebê é do Kaya. Nós nunca tivemos nada de verdade com o Demir.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.20,2:03:19.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:16.32,2:03:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele se casou comigo apenas por vingança.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.63,2:03:24.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:20.75,2:03:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas sinto que ele nutre sentimentos por mim...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.57,2:03:29.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:27.69,2:03:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...eu sinto isso.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.71,2:03:35.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:32.83,2:03:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece até que ele gosta do bebê na minha barriga.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.89,2:03:37.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:35.01,2:03:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas acho que isso não é amor.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.43,2:03:39.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:37.55,2:03:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Não pode ser.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.22,2:03:43.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:39.34,2:03:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,É como se ele buscasse um refúgio em qualquer coisa.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.92,2:03:47.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:45.04,2:03:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele também quer ser amado.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.94,2:03:52.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:50.06,2:03:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele é carente de amor.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.14,2:03:55.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:53.26,2:03:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Por isso tudo isso acontece.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.18,2:03:58.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:55.30,2:03:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele era assim com a Şeyda também.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.34,2:04:04.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:01.46,2:04:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois que a perdeu, tornou-se irreconhecível.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.39,2:04:06.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:04.51,2:04:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora está ainda pior, sabe?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.61,2:04:09.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:07.73,2:04:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Às vezes acontecem coisas...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.27,2:04:13.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:09.39,2:04:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,...ele fica agressivo como um bicho a quem tiraram a cria.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.04,2:04:14.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:13.16,2:04:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,E eu não sei o que fazer.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.52,2:04:17.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:14.64,2:04:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele faz alguma coisa com você?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.41,2:04:19.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:18.53,2:04:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, comigo não faz nada.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.13,2:04:22.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:19.25,2:04:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas nem por isso ninguém deve saber.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.05,2:04:24.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:22.17,2:04:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,O Kaya, principalmente, jamais pode sonhar com isso.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.26,2:04:27.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:24.38,2:04:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Eles já estão para se casar, não é?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.70,2:04:32.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:30.82,2:04:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Seria uma desgraça.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.19,2:04:36.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:34.31,2:04:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo ficaria arruinado, Nare.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.08,2:04:39.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:37.20,2:04:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Não diga nada ao meu irmão, por favor.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.40,2:04:41.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:39.52,2:04:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Não conte a ninguém lá em casa.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.46,2:04:42.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:41.58,2:04:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Zerrin, mas como vai ser isso?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.46,2:04:45.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:42.58,2:04:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está carregando o filho do Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.03,2:04:49.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:45.15,2:04:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não estou apenas carregando, Nare, estou tentando mantê-lo vivo!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.96,2:04:52.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:49.08,2:04:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,É a única maneira de conseguir isso, o que mais eu posso fazer?!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.41,2:04:56.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:52.53,2:04:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Só assim consigo proteger a mim mesma, ao Kaya e a este bebê.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.47,2:05:01.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:56.59,2:05:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Você já passou da 16ª semana... Não vai perguntar o sexo?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:09.25,2:05:11.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:09.37,2:05:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Não quer saber o sexo?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.04,2:05:18.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:16.16,2:05:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.39,2:05:26.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:24.51,2:05:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Por quê?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.49,2:05:35.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:27.61,2:05:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Porque se for menino, se a Dona Sadakat descobrir vai querer tirar de mim, e se meu pai souber não deixará viver.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.29,2:05:46.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:44.41,2:05:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde está a aliança?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.71,2:06:29.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:26.83,2:06:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite a todos. Bom apetite.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.88,2:07:26.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:24.00,2:07:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite, Kaya. Boa noite, papai.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:28.02,2:07:30.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:28.14,2:07:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite, meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.32,2:07:35.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:32.44,2:07:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Coma direitinho a sua comida, coma tudo.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.18,2:07:41.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:38.30,2:07:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não consigo comer tudo, vovó...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.79,2:07:44.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:42.91,2:07:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.91,2:07:51.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:50.03,2:07:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Diga, vovó.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.45,2:07:57.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:52.57,2:07:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,De agora em diante, não chame mais o Cihan de papai, meu anjo.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.17,2:07:59.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:57.29,2:07:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Por quê? Ele é meu pai!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.76,2:08:03.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:01.88,2:08:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Não. Ele é seu tio.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.01,2:08:07.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:05.13,2:08:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.89,2:08:10.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:08.01,2:08:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Não! Ele é meu pai! Você não me quer mais?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.74,2:08:12.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:10.86,2:08:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vou mais ser seu filho?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.39,2:08:15.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:13.51,2:08:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, meu filho, como você pode pensar isso?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.99,2:08:17.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:15.11,2:08:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,De jeito nenhum! Pelo amor de Deus!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.29,2:08:19.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:17.41,2:08:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é o meu filho, você é tudo pra mim.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.15,2:08:21.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:19.27,2:08:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sua avó não quis dizer isso, não é?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.85,2:08:24.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:20.97,2:08:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é tio dele! O que você pensa que está fazendo?!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.85,2:08:25.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:23.97,2:08:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela estava brincando, Alya. Ela só estava brincando.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.57,2:08:27.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:25.69,2:08:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha, vamos para o nosso quarto. Nós dois.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.61,2:08:31.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:27.73,2:08:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Era brincadeira? Você não vai deixar de ser meu pai?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.31,2:08:32.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:31.43,2:08:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha, vamos conversar um pouco.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.61,2:08:34.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:32.73,2:08:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não, não existe nada disso. De jeito nenhum.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.85,2:08:37.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:34.97,2:08:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha, vamos para o nosso quarto conversar.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.17,2:08:39.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:38.29,2:08:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, venha.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.59,2:08:50.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:48.71,2:08:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.34,2:08:55.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:54.46,2:08:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é tio dele.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.24,2:08:58.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:56.36,2:08:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sou o pai dele, mãe! O que você pensa que está fazendo?!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.51,2:09:02.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:59.63,2:09:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,O pai dele está deitado lá embaixo!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.17,2:09:04.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:02.29,2:09:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, o pai dele está deitado lá embaixo...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.77,2:09:05.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:04.89,2:09:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...está lá embaixo, mãe!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.08,2:09:07.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:06.20,2:09:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, o pai dele está no limbo!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.85,2:09:09.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:07.97,2:09:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,O que nós vamos dizer a essa criança, mãe?!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.66,2:09:11.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:09.78,2:09:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,'Não sabemos se o seu pai está vivo ou morto'?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:11.84,2:09:14.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:11.96,2:09:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,'Venha esperar ao lado dele como faz a sua avó'? É isso que vamos dizer?!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.10,2:09:17.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:15.22,2:09:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran vai viver!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:16.82,2:09:18.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:16.94,2:09:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.85,2:09:21.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:19.97,2:09:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai viver!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.46,2:09:24.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:22.58,2:09:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Até que ele fique de pé, o pai dele sou eu, mãe!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.29,2:09:27.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:25.41,2:09:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nunca mais diga o contrário!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.09,2:09:31.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:29.21,2:09:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, chega!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:00.61,2:10:02.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:00.73,2:10:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Acordou, meu filho?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.43,2:10:28.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:26.55,2:10:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Não... Por que o meu pai dorme daquele jeito?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.73,2:10:31.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:29.85,2:10:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Você veio, papai.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.71,2:10:38.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:35.83,2:10:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquei com muita pena da vovó...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.88,2:10:42.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:41.00,2:10:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também fiquei muito triste.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.35,2:10:47.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:45.47,2:10:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,E fiquei com muita pena do meu pai também.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.32,2:10:53.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:48.44,2:10:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas quando você chegou, senti como se meu pai tivesse acordado.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.37,2:11:01.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:59.49,2:11:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é o meu pai agora.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.18,2:11:21.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:18.30,2:11:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem, vamos dormir abraçadinhos.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:25.53,2:11:27.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:25.65,2:11:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Não fica triste.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.69,2:11:29.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:27.81,2:11:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, venha, você precisa dormir agora.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:29.31,2:11:29.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:29.43,2:11:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Não...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.00,2:11:33.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:31.12,2:11:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Você nem dormiu na outra noite, papai, por favor...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:36.90,2:11:39.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:37.02,2:11:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,E hoje eu estou muito triste, por favor...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.52,2:11:41.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:39.64,2:11:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Filho, venha cá...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.60,2:11:44.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:41.72,2:11:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem, venha cá. Venha.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:53.64,2:11:56.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:53.76,2:11:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu amo muito vocês dois.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.48,2:12:00.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:58.60,2:12:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós também te amamos muito.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:36.52,2:12:38.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:12:36.64,2:12:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele dormiu...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:32.42,2:13:34.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:32.54,2:13:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele adormeceu...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.34,2:13:36.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:34.46,2:13:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Está dormindo...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.96,2:13:40.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:36.08,2:13:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Com o Boran naquele estado lá embaixo, como vocês têm coragem de dormir abraçados aqui?!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:40.46,2:13:41.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:40.58,2:13:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Não têm um pingo de vergonha?!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:41.82,2:13:44.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:41.94,2:13:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,E você, Cihan, não tem um pingo de consciência?!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:44.58,2:13:45.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:44.70,2:13:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, saia daqui!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:45.93,2:13:48.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:46.05,2:13:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,O Deniz vai acordar!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:58.33,2:14:00.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:58.45,2:14:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está dormindo...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:15.64,2:14:18.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:14:15.76,2:14:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Alya, Senhor Cihan...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:42.25,2:14:44.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:14:42.37,2:14:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Pois não.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:55.39,2:14:57.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:14:55.51,2:14:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pois não, Dona Emine.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.43,2:15:02.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:00.55,2:15:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.44,2:15:08.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:06.56,2:15:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A Dona Sadakat...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.61,2:15:10.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:09.73,2:15:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...está chamando vocês na sala.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.44,2:15:25.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:22.56,2:15:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela chamou você também, então.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.91,2:15:33.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:33.03,2:15:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem, está bem.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.87,2:15:36.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:33.99,2:15:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela chamou o advogado aqui também.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:49.08,2:15:51.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:49.20,2:15:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:12.49,2:16:13.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:12.61,2:16:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.33,2:16:14.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:13.45,2:16:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,O que houve, Kaya?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.45,2:16:16.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:14.57,2:16:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Não sei, irmão. Minha mãe chamou e eu vim.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:17.21,2:16:20.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:17.33,2:16:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu chamei para que ele ouça o que tenho a dizer.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.17,2:16:25.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:22.29,2:16:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Diga logo o que tem para dizer...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.69,2:16:30.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:26.81,2:16:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sente-se aí, Kaya, e escute você também.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.03,2:16:33.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:31.15,2:16:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat, sem rodeios...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.39,2:16:42.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:38.51,2:16:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Não enrolar também é meu maior desejo, Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:49.65,2:16:51.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:49.77,2:16:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A aliança de casamento do Boran.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:59.97,2:17:02.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:00.09,2:17:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Com o seu nome gravado dentro, Dona Alya.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.23,2:17:04.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:02.35,2:17:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Este casamento foi anulado.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.64,2:17:21.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:20.76,2:17:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,É o que diz a lei.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:27.82,2:17:30.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:27.94,2:17:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Já que você é jurista, diga: estou certa ou não?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:32.23,2:17:35.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:32.35,2:17:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A senhora tem razão, Dona Sadakat.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:36.02,2:17:40.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:36.14,2:17:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Se o cônjuge registrado como falecido reaparecer com vida...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:44.09,2:17:48.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:44.21,2:17:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,...o casamento atual torna-se nulo de pleno direito.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:47.87,2:17:53.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:47.99,2:17:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Em outras palavras, o casamento de vocês é considerado inválido desde o início.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:05.70,2:18:09.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:05.82,2:18:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouviram da boca do próprio advogado de vocês!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:15.78,2:18:20.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:15.90,2:18:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora vocês vão assinar este acordo e se separarão imediatamente!
